window.EXAUD={"If Lan practises every day, she will have the ability to swim 500 metres.": "audio/cau/acb77272bebc7012.mp3", "\"Can\" in this sentence shows ability.": "audio/cau/e1e778d1a8135d61.mp3", "Lan is able to swim very well.": "audio/cau/a3fff5ce630221f2.mp3", "He was too tired to be able to relax.": "audio/cau/edfb4c7decfc2430.mp3", "His academic results are very good.": "audio/cau/b14f1f6649236bf4.mp3", "The academic year starts in September.": "audio/cau/85bfbfaac9a285f0.mp3", "Please accept this small gift from our class.": "audio/cau/86e7a0b4e2454140.mp3", "Lan accepted the invitation, but Minh refused it.": "audio/cau/ac6f7b1f73f4208f.mp3", "Being late is not acceptable.": "audio/cau/8a3b1f0c015e9312.mp3", "Your answer is acceptable.": "audio/cau/d2e54ceeb4996328.mp3", "She got a letter of acceptance from the school.": "audio/cau/626c65e15c7204bc.mp3", "Acceptance of others is important.": "audio/cau/3707bfbecddfcd67.mp3", "Tickets are 50,000 dong for adults.": "audio/cau/acb3b6176262fa6b.mp3", "Children must swim with an adult.": "audio/cau/3a59f4c818a8fe7c.mp3", "Hoa is always polite when she talks to adults.": "audio/cau/30f664238e37dbc6.mp3", "Adults need about eight hours of sleep.": "audio/cau/965ef8331141619a.mp3", "'In the park' is an adverbial phrase.": "audio/cau/efd1987e02b10f37.mp3", "Underline the adverbial phrases of time.": "audio/cau/04b374ee3328461f.mp3", "Can you say that again, please?": "audio/cau/7e3810543bbdcfd8.mp3", "Mi read the story again and again.": "audio/cau/1afa85aeab810227.mp3", "We must keep our traditional crafts alive.": "audio/cau/461c910cfd0f1264.mp3", "The old tree is still alive, but that one is dead.": "audio/cau/713514d344b69a38.mp3", "Lan likes music. She also likes drawing.": "audio/cau/a42927a6760bdc56.mp3", "Nam speaks English and also learns Japanese.": "audio/cau/d657bddc45a35d0d.mp3", "My mother always gets up early.": "audio/cau/018f205f8d900a21.mp3", "Nam always does his homework, but he never watches TV late.": "audio/cau/bed514ec413923ae.mp3", "I am a student at Kim Dong School.": "audio/cau/7c9effe742362b92.mp3", "I am in Class 6A, and my friends are in 6B.": "audio/cau/69bce6abc68e1822.mp3", "Please answer the teacher's question.": "audio/cau/f790ccdd60f40ece.mp3", "Nam asks and Hoa answers.": "audio/cau/128cffcafde831b9.mp3", "Check your answers with a partner.": "audio/cau/8656910f569b2925.mp3", "Lan can answer all the questions, and her answers are correct.": "audio/cau/df2a478d26596242.mp3", "Choose the appropriate word.": "audio/cau/66d27cf01d74a6da.mp3", "Jeans are not appropriate for school.": "audio/cau/6ad146df6ac906f5.mp3", "I take breaks appropriately when I study.": "audio/cau/dc1ca841b56b6f07.mp3", "Students should dress appropriately for school.": "audio/cau/38525965836f746d.mp3", "Mi and Nam are in Class 6A.": "audio/cau/b0d165e52ca7dc85.mp3", "We are happy today, and Lan is happy too.": "audio/cau/9718e7702bade08e.mp3", "The baby is asleep in her room.": "audio/cau/0fcf9f481653136f.mp3", "Nam fell asleep at ten and slept for eight hours.": "audio/cau/9a3306cb5d5d72e2.mp3", "We have a school assembly on Monday.": "audio/cau/8cce9f4203e028bd.mp3", "This is a car assembly line.": "audio/cau/5212b496e3a1524d.mp3", "He passed the test on his first attempt.": "audio/cau/915d7d5bf914a531.mp3", "She attempted to climb the tree.": "audio/cau/b6e3d6387089c847.mp3", "I attend Le Loi Secondary School.": "audio/cau/2106fb1a21b48167.mp3", "Many people attended the festival.": "audio/cau/d86fc7a983ad38ca.mp3", "The audience clapped after the song.": "audio/cau/163ef8d0960bcd71.mp3", "The singer thanked the audience, and the viewers cheered.": "audio/cau/0eb5ef70dc3bd7df.mp3", "You should sleep eight hours a night if you want to be awake and fully alert.": "audio/cau/45c0c4c3aa5602c1.mp3", "Are you still awake? It's midnight.": "audio/cau/fe9ef9cda8f30799.mp3", "Look at picture b and answer.": "audio/cau/b2672a8a1898ddda.mp3", "Write the letter b next to the right answer.": "audio/cau/9ec7b58bf879e0bc.mp3", "He came back to his village after the war.": "audio/cau/97697c4a9d748fa3.mp3", "Nam went to Hue and came back on Sunday.": "audio/cau/1bf8eb10f268125e.mp3", "My grandpa often has a backache.": "audio/cau/f68ec1e3fdcd023f.mp3", "Sit up straight to avoid backache.": "audio/cau/18176540051b1220.mp3", "Eating too much sugar is bad for your teeth.": "audio/cau/385b55508b3849c3.mp3", "The traffic was bad today, but yesterday it was worse.": "audio/cau/4db5861a9ee30736.mp3", "The city was badly affected by the flood.": "audio/cau/1e256308778b183a.mp3", "Nam played badly today, but yesterday he played worse.": "audio/cau/c2078c45e0d95aa8.mp3", "My school bag is very heavy.": "audio/cau/81c86f54e6817fa3.mp3", "Mi has a red bag, and Lan has two blue bags.": "audio/cau/33eb6b7417d04199.mp3", "Please use cloth bags instead of plastic bags.": "audio/cau/6e414fb5f6866be5.mp3", "This bag is old, so Mum bought two new bags.": "audio/cau/5c197b55387c41e0.mp3", "Please be quiet in the library.": "audio/cau/d6fab02a2655be4e.mp3", "I want to be a doctor. My sister is a nurse.": "audio/cau/e31166f3ca032296.mp3", "She became a famous writer at the age of 30.": "audio/cau/d039f1fb340db200.mp3", "Nam's father became a doctor, and Nam wants to become one.": "audio/cau/75c8536f0f8b5b1b.mp3", "The city has become more crowded.": "audio/cau/e4616f3fdd933bf4.mp3", "Lan became a teacher, and her brother will become a doctor.": "audio/cau/534acc7a3aea852d.mp3", "Thank you for being so kind to me.": "audio/cau/a75c0878deadd1e7.mp3", "Being a doctor is hard, but my aunt is happy.": "audio/cau/4aa63f5a96fb8206.mp3", "I believe you.": "audio/cau/c1b7bfc3adc01b41.mp3", "Do you believe in ghosts?": "audio/cau/83a7564931d63151.mp3", "Our school has a big garden.": "audio/cau/6b86817f41024790.mp3", "My house is big, but Minh's house is bigger.": "audio/cau/1d7d2b8d19284673.mp3", "Fill in each blank with one word.": "audio/cau/0b238b46fd929b2f.mp3", "Write the correct answer in the blank.": "audio/cau/8d62e86f859c14ce.mp3", "The film was long and boring.": "audio/cau/2fb37c98bad76a4f.mp3", "The lesson was boring, so Nam felt bored.": "audio/cau/0b9b11807d964d8b.mp3", "There is a cat in the box.": "audio/cau/2e85eeb9526b3b0e.mp3", "Put the toys in the box; we have three boxes.": "audio/cau/94612872a7e7c8fc.mp3", "The toys are in the boxes.": "audio/cau/170d9e1f4536be5e.mp3", "Mai puts her books in two boxes.": "audio/cau/895f5119e1e2f239.mp3", "The boy next to Mi is my brother.": "audio/cau/2b8e169ba1253282.mp3", "There are ten boys and twelve girls in my class.": "audio/cau/f109fb5b9db06caa.mp3", "Use the words in brackets.": "audio/cau/496e7371ea0c5719.mp3", "Put the verb in the bracket in the correct form.": "audio/cau/dab9456e755cf63f.mp3", "Put the verbs in brackets in the correct form.": "audio/cau/db94e0ded7cf0ad1.mp3", "Write the word in brackets, like this: (go).": "audio/cau/35267fe98d59e0cc.mp3", "My brother is ten years old.": "audio/cau/8117bffc8b9c9ebf.mp3", "Lan has two brothers and one sister.": "audio/cau/2a5491a08996a7e7.mp3", "The correct answer is c.": "audio/cau/115cc222c2d7fb6e.mp3", "Look at picture c and describe the girl.": "audio/cau/a211a53ea5c1cc24.mp3", "My village is calm and green.": "audio/cau/bc7c091bd908318d.mp3", "The streets are calm and quiet at night.": "audio/cau/2a74b9e92030e5a3.mp3", "The first iPhone came in 2007.": "audio/cau/b74af45c313ce91a.mp3", "Lan came to my house, and then we went to the park.": "audio/cau/db2ce9de70166e15.mp3", "Mi can swim very well.": "audio/cau/3e8edac082144330.mp3", "I can ride a bike now, but last year I couldn't.": "audio/cau/af33705bbc26781d.mp3", "I can't find my pencil case.": "audio/cau/eb6d0d717595fc1e.mp3", "Nam can swim, but he can't play the guitar.": "audio/cau/7d46b51b1e362522.mp3", "A friend of yours cannot get a good night's sleep.": "audio/cau/44dd417be1715182.mp3", "I cannot hear you. It's too noisy.": "audio/cau/c25f8e78a3e62ab2.mp3", "She has the capability to lead the team.": "audio/cau/6b1a9fe7a25d32b6.mp3", "This robot has the capability to talk.": "audio/cau/a9ed871b405790ed.mp3", "Old people in my village need special care.": "audio/cau/e2b32589dc4d57eb.mp3", "Lan takes care of her little brother very carefully.": "audio/cau/0449e85740a5edad.mp3", "She wants a career in medicine.": "audio/cau/dfb8aa868f280f7b.mp3", "He had a long career as a teacher.": "audio/cau/87dd212fe8a2de15.mp3", "Be careful when you cross the road.": "audio/cau/7d44eca76d25a07d.mp3", "Nam is careful, so he writes carefully.": "audio/cau/3961f897eee5f47e.mp3", "Listen carefully and repeat after me.": "audio/cau/ad3f1bf6d7562211.mp3", "Mi is careful, so she always writes carefully.": "audio/cau/6be5befe9f5467c7.mp3", "Don't be careless with fire.": "audio/cau/3fa8f5ce401f56eb.mp3", "He made a careless mistake.": "audio/cau/0e576f1b557d8217.mp3", "They carried out a study about city life.": "audio/cau/741e882cd91f0aed.mp3", "The old buses carried many passengers.": "audio/cau/1d29e18f669abb89.mp3", "Put the cat in the carrier.": "audio/cau/0d2221276a0a0ac3.mp3", "The mail carrier comes every morning.": "audio/cau/fb9a3cbe383ebc8b.mp3", "Can you help me carry this box?": "audio/cau/a0f121aef5c03fe7.mp3", "Lan carried her books, and today she carries her bag.": "audio/cau/e736c67580379245.mp3", "Too many cars cause traffic jams.": "audio/cau/5ac4cbb3cb2d00fb.mp3", "Pollution is a cause of illness and can cause problems.": "audio/cau/b0502415132a3591.mp3", "Be cautious when you cross the road.": "audio/cau/9dd111c2f2e4c687.mp3", "She is a cautious driver.": "audio/cau/b817922787a617d7.mp3", "I often chat with my neighbours.": "audio/cau/f9bdc10e4250f241.mp3", "Mi and Lan had a long chat after school.": "audio/cau/92771962baaa6db3.mp3", "My uncle is a chef in a hotel.": "audio/cau/5c42bcbbb8b0392f.mp3", "The chef cooks delicious phở.": "audio/cau/29123f0c464d23ba.mp3", "The chefs are busy in the kitchen.": "audio/cau/4a785c6fe1219038.mp3", "Famous chefs cook on TV.": "audio/cau/9a2062512808ad31.mp3", "Every child in the village goes to school.": "audio/cau/9f966cc92f3b2d70.mp3", "When he was a child, he lived with his grandparents.": "audio/cau/5f1982ddb057760f.mp3", "I had a happy childhood in the countryside.": "audio/cau/29493d8d0469345f.mp3", "This song reminds me of my childhood.": "audio/cau/a5f0b56f6286f10d.mp3", "Don't be childish; say sorry.": "audio/cau/3e2e6a125ca40003.mp3", "That is a childish game.": "audio/cau/acd7fb585862d0ca.mp3", "She has three children and two grandchildren.": "audio/cau/41e17d5597e264f0.mp3", "One child was quiet, but the other children were noisy.": "audio/cau/863bff50c6e9f303.mp3", "The children's toys are in the box.": "audio/cau/cdeee14e089eb2bf.mp3", "This is a children's book.": "audio/cau/624cb6387e8b1a85.mp3", "You have a choice of tea or juice.": "audio/cau/d83c640d99d55e18.mp3", "I think you made a good choice.": "audio/cau/89c0a3eddbcb6efd.mp3", "There are many choices on the menu.": "audio/cau/1f222063b28d7615.mp3", "Make healthy food choices.": "audio/cau/430025ea2ad0eec0.mp3", "Choose the correct answer.": "audio/cau/9bb3b69b3f099527.mp3", "Mi chose a red pen. It was a good choice.": "audio/cau/4fabb83c5ec962f5.mp3", "I chose the bus because it is cheap.": "audio/cau/9c85ffa2fb7223db.mp3", "You can choose one, and Nam chose the red one.": "audio/cau/3684e06d8810f79f.mp3", "She was chosen as class monitor.": "audio/cau/77ca45b3c93c0c06.mp3", "Have you chosen a book yet?": "audio/cau/69586b45796a6e5b.mp3", "Big cities often have traffic jams.": "audio/cau/290573a9de9b8727.mp3", "Ha Noi is a city, and Hue is a city too.": "audio/cau/723b5f4c4ced8460.mp3", "Every citizen should obey the law.": "audio/cau/ea7f4c7f2b1f7427.mp3", "He is a Vietnamese citizen.": "audio/cau/e80d176ec8a69643.mp3", "I live in a big city.": "audio/cau/66e0022bec290560.mp3", "Life in the city is busier than in the countryside.": "audio/cau/ec0678a3bad99639.mp3", "Speak with clarity so everyone understands.": "audio/cau/b17e50f6d06efaa6.mp3", "The photo has great clarity.": "audio/cau/d8eaeaca6ddb4a4f.mp3", "There are forty students in my class.": "audio/cau/69f347ac209b4fc2.mp3", "Nam is my classmate. We are in the same class.": "audio/cau/e6a0aa2aaff4be27.mp3", "Our school has twenty classes.": "audio/cau/c3a891dc027e3741.mp3", "We have English classes on Monday.": "audio/cau/cd49a2bc4c3e1c86.mp3", "Nam is my new classmate.": "audio/cau/8f038868644223fc.mp3", "My classmate and I sit in the same classroom.": "audio/cau/ebc5ea3d6e23a8ba.mp3", "Our classroom is on the second floor.": "audio/cau/c460b559d453bdeb.mp3", "My classmates and I clean the classroom on Fridays.": "audio/cau/9cf5ce52e3da16c8.mp3", "This sentence has two clauses.": "audio/cau/1848ea41fac28299.mp3", "A relative clause gives more information.": "audio/cau/011caf5df58a8fa7.mp3", "Join the two clauses with 'and'.": "audio/cau/2c07fa09cb574d80.mp3", "We learn about if clauses today.": "audio/cau/dea9e0b4217e18ac.mp3", "Her goal in life was very clear.": "audio/cau/0960d8382dfe4e74.mp3", "The teacher's voice is clear, so we hear her clearly.": "audio/cau/f8c8cb276c506e09.mp3", "Please speak clearly and slowly.": "audio/cau/bd9b0aafe2596459.mp3", "The sign is clear, so we can read it clearly.": "audio/cau/424ef8e97612359a.mp3", "This bag is made of cloth.": "audio/cau/7733aaa3678ed9a6.mp3", "Clean the table with a wet cloth.": "audio/cau/9de57f8b2cc33a0d.mp3", "This shop sells traditional clothes.": "audio/cau/f9f8fc01958edcec.mp3", "These clothes are made from silk cloth.": "audio/cau/19f3df33d3f79b2d.mp3", "Bring warm clothing for the trip.": "audio/cau/cabe691534654654.mp3", "This shop sells children's clothing.": "audio/cau/1bba2a627a5e83ee.mp3", "I came down with a cold last week.": "audio/cau/6589d8d2056f15e9.mp3", "It is cold in Ha Noi in winter.": "audio/cau/6af5e5587fe6cf7a.mp3", "He left college to start a company.": "audio/cau/0368b7db1d098b96.mp3", "My sister goes to college, and my brother goes to university.": "audio/cau/a6ce51f4920cae10.mp3", "Write the words in the correct column.": "audio/cau/9cbba6ca551c15bd.mp3", "The table has three columns and five rows.": "audio/cau/0995b40d17116e2c.mp3", "Combine the two sentences into one.": "audio/cau/75b44c365a6934d3.mp3", "You can combine study and fun.": "audio/cau/d0f44663f94462e9.mp3", "Please come to my birthday party.": "audio/cau/6800288294234b0b.mp3", "Nam came to school early yesterday.": "audio/cau/e4484967a289b802.mp3", "My new friend is coming to my house.": "audio/cau/364032ec5fb1b2d1.mp3", "Lan came yesterday, and Hoa is coming today.": "audio/cau/2a3f62b0b9c0734e.mp3", "The comparative of 'big' is 'bigger'.": "audio/cau/4e28e78ae9e0c458.mp3", "We compare two cities using the comparative.": "audio/cau/928477415d139668.mp3", "Compare your answers with your partner.": "audio/cau/f8be7b0e308e141f.mp3", "Let's compare the two pictures and find the differences.": "audio/cau/d1518af4c2a94436.mp3", "Make a comparison between city and country life.": "audio/cau/4eb51db2fe33ea37.mp3", "We learn comparison of adjectives.": "audio/cau/02353122847ea89a.mp3", "Complete the sentences with the words.": "audio/cau/a10abe8427f587a5.mp3", "Mi completed her homework. Now it is complete.": "audio/cau/e89d49e3a54806e8.mp3", "Lan completely forgot her friend's birthday.": "audio/cau/ae968fd2ecb01b87.mp3", "Minh completely forgot about his homework.": "audio/cau/4ec9cda7a9209eb1.mp3", "Can you compute the total cost?": "audio/cau/a8d41aba6d2ab55f.mp3", "Machines can compute very fast.": "audio/cau/72c349cdf691477f.mp3", "He bought his first computer at sixteen.": "audio/cau/89b36254c871cb46.mp3", "She studied computing and now makes computer games.": "audio/cau/bc002ad22303f977.mp3", "Computing is my favourite subject.": "audio/cau/bd53d2b166706315.mp3", "She wants to study computing at university.": "audio/cau/dc25a1b43d7542f9.mp3", "'Although' is used for clauses of concession.": "audio/cau/9cf4ab5d00408440.mp3", "Both sides made a concession.": "audio/cau/263f1a45f269be2d.mp3", "Phong feels confident before the test.": "audio/cau/7a19526f5070486e.mp3", "Lan was shy, but now she speaks confidently.": "audio/cau/12ff535fa02bf353.mp3", "Talk calmly to solve conflicts.": "audio/cau/ee5a09cbab66464e.mp3", "Conflicts between friends are normal.": "audio/cau/866430b943e8c1d3.mp3", "'But' is a conjunction.": "audio/cau/12423466f2a54b1b.mp3", "Use a conjunction to join the sentences.": "audio/cau/7dc188a73daf4cba.mp3", "Physical health is connected with your body.": "audio/cau/634a8a166182ee10.mp3", "Social media helps teens stay connected.": "audio/cau/47a2c362738b4ca7.mp3", "Consider your answer before you speak.": "audio/cau/aa283697b91d51a7.mp3", "We are considering a trip to Huế.": "audio/cau/d54aa62d0d4e182d.mp3", "Pictures can convey feelings.": "audio/cau/b45023c10ff5cb69.mp3", "He conveyed the message to the class.": "audio/cau/b99a3ce158152ab0.mp3", "My mum and I cook dinner in the kitchen.": "audio/cau/099d18a7b607e37e.mp3", "Dad is a good cook, and he loves cooking.": "audio/cau/ad61c98703aba283.mp3", "There's a cooker in the kitchen.": "audio/cau/ccb1cac6fa236187.mp3", "Mum is cooking rice on the cooker.": "audio/cau/2fb33fad1e4bbdd3.mp3", "Mi is cooking lunch now.": "audio/cau/cdaf6ad6f2a96daf.mp3", "My dad cooks well, and he is cooking fish today.": "audio/cau/656e2272945939a2.mp3", "My mum cooks well-balanced meals for our family.": "audio/cau/4fd0530b7e1343c6.mp3", "Minh cooks noodles for breakfast on Sundays.": "audio/cau/4d92f19743058548.mp3", "Thanks for your cooperation.": "audio/cau/d29faba5310e58c1.mp3", "Teamwork needs good cooperation.": "audio/cau/8818c86d83457bf4.mp3", "Dancing needs good coordination.": "audio/cau/a0de70894e3f8a92.mp3", "Good coordination helps the team win.": "audio/cau/84a8506400c2ab89.mp3", "Choose the correct answer A, B or C.": "audio/cau/6f45c31e9ee537be.mp3", "Nam's answer is correct, but mine is wrong.": "audio/cau/2f88ef38a2385ee5.mp3", "The teacher made corrections in red.": "audio/cau/895634813fdf81d2.mp3", "Check your corrections carefully.": "audio/cau/c829f7ab4f978d5b.mp3", "Try to say these new words correctly.": "audio/cau/d4da04af4337ec0f.mp3", "Her answer is correct because she read the question correctly.": "audio/cau/cee1de65a2a9d88f.mp3", "Could you tell me the way to the market?": "audio/cau/caec542f1754918b.mp3", "I can swim now, but I could not swim last year.": "audio/cau/15650b94c8bd4313.mp3", "I couldn't sleep because of the noise.": "audio/cau/b74c0028cf6704f5.mp3", "Lan could swim, but she couldn't ride a bike.": "audio/cau/478ae99fe7a51e30.mp3", "Life in the countryside is peaceful.": "audio/cau/95479ebba178019f.mp3", "The city is noisy, but the countryside is quiet.": "audio/cau/37f198fe8e1a722b.mp3", "A young couple lives next door.": "audio/cau/d0f20b42a6aca611.mp3", "Wait a couple of minutes.": "audio/cau/88b6985e0d22ec59.mp3", "Lan creates a to-do list every Sunday evening.": "audio/cau/87a26e3235a8f368.mp3", "Our class created a poster about healthy living.": "audio/cau/97dc8c8a67b315e5.mp3", "This dish is the chef's own creation.": "audio/cau/fc920ec6ff357284.mp3", "The creation of the park took two years.": "audio/cau/e03b9893206b7583.mp3", "Hoa is very creative in art class.": "audio/cau/d1a85d15ebb2ea7b.mp3", "Nam is creative. He likes to create new games.": "audio/cau/a92d851d2aed43a0.mp3", "Art lessons help students show their creativity.": "audio/cau/ef2eb572bc331261.mp3", "Phong is creative, and his creativity makes our class fun.": "audio/cau/c91d4b0dff266adb.mp3", "He is the creator of this cartoon.": "audio/cau/acc70c5a959cdcc3.mp3", "She is a young content creator.": "audio/cau/e8d143a8558b806e.mp3", "The restaurant is full of customers.": "audio/cau/ce436668971bffdf.mp3", "Customers can pay by card.": "audio/cau/d84161140468e064.mp3", "Look at picture d and answer the question.": "audio/cau/cd1db823a64876e3.mp3", "Choose answer d, then write it in your notebook.": "audio/cau/d8924058670ef40e.mp3", "My dad is a doctor.": "audio/cau/87de43de098d8ab6.mp3", "My dad cooks dinner, and my mum washes the dishes.": "audio/cau/8ca0dad82745ad96.mp3", "Traffic jams are part of daily life in Ha Noi.": "audio/cau/c95ad670d219bd23.mp3", "Nam reads the news daily, every day before school.": "audio/cau/7ddb05aad387c96a.mp3", "I have English every day.": "audio/cau/50a9802d88a8dbc0.mp3", "Nam studies by day and sleeps at night.": "audio/cau/0f498730d8ee8697.mp3", "There are seven days in a week.": "audio/cau/4193126d14e614a3.mp3", "I study English daily, even on busy days.": "audio/cau/f6f890f7b3bda2bf.mp3", "The death of his dog made him sad.": "audio/cau/16557e1350bb02d1.mp3", "Smoking can cause death.": "audio/cau/e5da19be59040040.mp3", "Teenagers can make their own decisions.": "audio/cau/b5431769132caed1.mp3", "Good leaders make quick decisions.": "audio/cau/8839e0dccae57664.mp3", "The man is delivering pizza.": "audio/cau/89d51f4790cf658a.mp3", "Thank you for delivering the letter.": "audio/cau/bed86f5f4d035388.mp3", "Being a doctor is a demanding job.": "audio/cau/7cfae7eba071856e.mp3", "Our teacher is very demanding.": "audio/cau/301d48f04f8704ee.mp3", "She wants to design clothes when she grows up.": "audio/cau/73e28be0aedd98a0.mp3", "Hoa is a designer; she designs school uniforms.": "audio/cau/654b4ba1f4bbceb2.mp3", "She wants to be a fashion designer.": "audio/cau/7eb916336ea71b61.mp3", "The designer made a new logo.": "audio/cau/d5d68202fffded5a.mp3", "Young designers showed their clothes.": "audio/cau/4faa8ce2b07e5d44.mp3", "Game designers create fun games.": "audio/cau/460a0ef6a451af2a.mp3", "They are designing a new park for the city.": "audio/cau/47d115e72d8ef002.mp3", "Minh enjoys designing, and he designed this poster.": "audio/cau/37b4e58dc3f850b4.mp3", "My desk is next to the window.": "audio/cau/e8ec7e6d606e8c39.mp3", "Each student has a desk, so we have forty desks.": "audio/cau/53254f045d6e0dc6.mp3", "I did my homework last night.": "audio/cau/52c1dc6ad84a16a5.mp3", "Did you do the project? Yes, I did.": "audio/cau/ce2a17ba3a5d2ade.mp3", "I didn't go to school yesterday.": "audio/cau/c76b3c893f3c0f4c.mp3", "Nam didn't do his homework, but Lan did.": "audio/cau/16f96f608ec2f72d.mp3", "Maths is difficult for me.": "audio/cau/16bb57fb47e5df02.mp3", "This test is difficult, but that one is easy.": "audio/cau/56b22511f0d64b7c.mp3", "I have difficulty in pronouncing this word.": "audio/cau/f0983c29e5893490.mp3", "She solved the problem without difficulty.": "audio/cau/0c8af826fc6c33c1.mp3", "Lan is a diligent student.": "audio/cau/10f7a91fa72fd9c7.mp3", "Vietnamese farmers are very diligent.": "audio/cau/640ace8256f3fb4c.mp3", "Let's discuss the problem in groups.": "audio/cau/cef13322a0d3b68b.mp3", "We discuss the plan, and the discussion takes ten minutes.": "audio/cau/a31966bdeac63e89.mp3", "We had a discussion about city life.": "audio/cau/d84c065603f75017.mp3", "After the discussion, we discussed it again with our teacher.": "audio/cau/054b4021e8aa37b4.mp3", "I dislike noisy and crowded places.": "audio/cau/5ace2bb2616bf75c.mp3", "Mi likes cats, but she dislikes dogs.": "audio/cau/a21ccd81f7c8d400.mp3", "I do my homework after dinner.": "audio/cau/dfa2558950305f83.mp3", "Phong did his homework, and now it is done.": "audio/cau/4e496982963ec9df.mp3", "Does Lan like ice cream?": "audio/cau/15298c934c7dedf6.mp3", "Nam does his homework, but he doesn't watch TV.": "audio/cau/16100881d98fba74.mp3", "I have done my homework.": "audio/cau/319d28fa8d112271.mp3", "Nam did the test well; he has done a great job.": "audio/cau/a6f61635ce93b0e4.mp3", "Can you draw a cat?": "audio/cau/be2932fbc93e80e5.mp3", "Hoa drew a flower and gave me the drawing.": "audio/cau/8ef26c64079b1115.mp3", "Lan's drawing is on the wall.": "audio/cau/e1c99913c9bb1dcf.mp3", "Minh draws well. He drew this drawing yesterday.": "audio/cau/a06a821e60587e14.mp3", "My brother draws pictures of animals.": "audio/cau/f72f002c0ce9c3b5.mp3", "Mi draws every day, and last week she drew a horse.": "audio/cau/c53f78fbfbf3ff78.mp3", "He drew a cat on the board.": "audio/cau/60aeb1a679f13bef.mp3", "We drew pictures in the art lesson.": "audio/cau/cffb3f0aaad7fa4f.mp3", "Steve Jobs' early life was not easy.": "audio/cau/870d0cf6ff3509a5.mp3", "Lan came early, but Nam came late.": "audio/cau/c338abccaad4e9f4.mp3", "This English exercise is very easy.": "audio/cau/708befc5d340e6e4.mp3", "This question is easy, but that one is difficult.": "audio/cau/6ec1dbc0277d41ef.mp3", "Pollution has a bad effect on our health.": "audio/cau/32ec342acb60fff2.mp3", "Music has a good effect on my mood.": "audio/cau/b2c4eb3d334a5125.mp3", "I write an email to my friend.": "audio/cau/8064d18c7a033e0f.mp3", "Lan emails me, and I read her email after school.": "audio/cau/b047656f3b7ce202.mp3", "At the end of the story, he became a hero.": "audio/cau/4cef74a2fd4fb11a.mp3", "We read to the end, and the ending was happy.": "audio/cau/fc827bfa0e26aa94.mp3", "Our PE teacher is very energetic.": "audio/cau/0f20bc2cdf1fdbbc.mp3", "I feel energetic after a good sleep.": "audio/cau/38346e6197dce33e.mp3", "My father is an engineer.": "audio/cau/cdd8a4927ecc40e0.mp3", "The engineer built a new bridge.": "audio/cau/22076e7df9759986.mp3", "Engineers are designing a new robot.": "audio/cau/1dda86937264b48e.mp3", "Many engineers work in this factory.": "audio/cau/3de63edb92d1df1c.mp3", "I enjoy living in the city.": "audio/cau/1cc10e53aebeec12.mp3", "We enjoy the trip because it is very enjoyable.": "audio/cau/1a682a8a24ff63b3.mp3", "I do my homework in the evening.": "audio/cau/4615eb9cc8fbce85.mp3", "Good evening! We have dinner every evening at seven.": "audio/cau/737b0c650458cf41.mp3", "Cooking is an everyday activity for my mum.": "audio/cau/03801a514b91f476.mp3", "We use everyday English every day at school.": "audio/cau/61f0eab70fe5dd6e.mp3", "She excels at maths.": "audio/cau/189cef5080b7a458.mp3", "He excels in sports.": "audio/cau/28d9649e2db915c6.mp3", "Our school is known for excellence in teaching.": "audio/cau/bd51c7b26703ffd9.mp3", "She got an award for excellence.": "audio/cau/e102f2ac0cb5c3d0.mp3", "Hoa is excellent at managing her time.": "audio/cau/de820656572c573c.mp3", "Minh got an excellent mark in the English test.": "audio/cau/68dcd9cc4329d16b.mp3", "The team played excellently.": "audio/cau/f46f094c071d44fe.mp3", "She sang the song excellently.": "audio/cau/5aead8608ae5d92b.mp3", "City life is exciting for teens.": "audio/cau/28945e456a70e4ca.mp3", "The trip was exciting, so we were very excited.": "audio/cau/53c60dbfd0e789cf.mp3", "Exhaust from cars pollutes the air.": "audio/cau/dcb901b91191e936.mp3", "The exhaust fumes from motorbikes make the air dirty.": "audio/cau/a4e870c54943e39c.mp3", "Modal verbs express ability, permission or advice.": "audio/cau/9c1f08aacb3d36af.mp3", "Mai uses a drawing to express her feelings.": "audio/cau/e43ecbb0d592515d.mp3", "\"Break a leg\" is an English expression.": "audio/cau/03d61dde951cfe19.mp3", "Her facial expression showed she was sad.": "audio/cau/ce988b82d9baac3c.mp3", "Learn these useful expressions by heart.": "audio/cau/f77071b27c197d14.mp3", "Use expressions to show surprise.": "audio/cau/349580710e59c8ae.mp3", "She has very expressive eyes.": "audio/cau/2bd85d8e4e55b758.mp3", "He read the poem in an expressive voice.": "audio/cau/e3044d8bcefa667f.mp3", "Look at the audience and make eye contact.": "audio/cau/c4b16bbbce49770b.mp3", "Lan has big eyes and long black hair.": "audio/cau/15209ecb4d490c7b.mp3", "Smoke from factories makes the air dirty.": "audio/cau/c81ab4e4468cc59e.mp3", "My uncle works in a shoe factory near Ha Noi.": "audio/cau/cadf22ae030695ea.mp3", "This factory makes bikes and motorbikes.": "audio/cau/f3c9616567191f5a.mp3", "There are many factories in the industrial zone.": "audio/cau/a1bac638f590bcae.mp3", "Many families live in flats in Ha Noi.": "audio/cau/0f99802cf5d0ebaf.mp3", "Families get together at Tet.": "audio/cau/60357c1a8fa848a4.mp3", "There are four people in my family.": "audio/cau/8324f70f7fed9e74.mp3", "Many families in my village grow rice.": "audio/cau/5b179b43939643fc.mp3", "Hoi An is famous for its lanterns.": "audio/cau/be0831db3c3bf621.mp3", "General Giap became famous, and his fame spread worldwide.": "audio/cau/4eabd5e77fd10a06.mp3", "Lan is interested in fashion and music.": "audio/cau/c16e6190025bd97d.mp3", "These fashionable clothes are popular with teens.": "audio/cau/99dcfa9981242c08.mp3", "She always wears fashionable clothes.": "audio/cau/224deed31a6b7076.mp3", "This hairstyle is very fashionable now.": "audio/cau/a5da03bcff324a2f.mp3", "My favourite room is the kitchen.": "audio/cau/7fe9b9a43268f379.mp3", "Football is Nam's favourite sport.": "audio/cau/5418f30ef37044b0.mp3", "What are the features of a smart home?": "audio/cau/679cac73f28961f1.mp3", "The robot has many useful features.": "audio/cau/bb417b4c063a18bc.mp3", "I feed my cat twice a day.": "audio/cau/3a8f8f8f00f1daf9.mp3", "Yesterday Lan fed the fish in the pond.": "audio/cau/01b9c59f1a6a6265.mp3", "I feel happy when I am with my friends.": "audio/cau/347c7145dbd3848c.mp3", "Nam felt tired after the long trip.": "audio/cau/722683185c73007a.mp3", "I have a good feeling about the test.": "audio/cau/fe5f18ce79a79a07.mp3", "Hoa felt proud; it was a wonderful feeling.": "audio/cau/f6b8ed872b819448.mp3", "My mum feels tired after work.": "audio/cau/bc96c68538121391.mp3", "Minh feels at home now, but he felt lost at first.": "audio/cau/7109bc7dc93115b2.mp3", "I fell off my bike yesterday.": "audio/cau/a3c33315fda9b0ff.mp3", "She fell asleep in front of the TV.": "audio/cau/8b967a89a93410fe.mp3", "The children are flying kites in the field.": "audio/cau/cbc154160546b20b.mp3", "Farmers grow rice in the fields near our village.": "audio/cau/37cf9b7ad781c0dc.mp3", "Fill in the gaps with the correct words.": "audio/cau/fdb1b1c53693f72e.mp3", "Mi fills the glass, and now it is full.": "audio/cau/ebdf9cc5c316901a.mp3", "I can't find my pencil.": "audio/cau/8c42ffdede29d976.mp3", "Lan lost her key, but Nam found it.": "audio/cau/59b8a65c0d818025.mp3", "Report your group's findings to the class.": "audio/cau/113b416e3511e60b.mp3", "Nam found some facts, and we shared our findings.": "audio/cau/fb2f3c17395a9325.mp3", "Mi finds city life exciting.": "audio/cau/43581944ff348c1f.mp3", "Minh finds maths easy, and he found the test easy too.": "audio/cau/aef390d81e1b78f5.mp3", "I finish my homework before dinner.": "audio/cau/4c12023029931700.mp3", "Hoa started the project in May and finished it in June.": "audio/cau/92423d5fe3d5c777.mp3", "Firstly, Lan makes a to-do list every evening.": "audio/cau/d1bb0725d0ded095.mp3", "Firstly, we should plan our work ahead.": "audio/cau/41a731569d9018b1.mp3", "We need food and water every day.": "audio/cau/01b6dc39aa643a2b.mp3", "Mum feeds the baby healthy food.": "audio/cau/1407b84140607171.mp3", "Write short notes, not full sentences.": "audio/cau/14bb97e16bb6d06a.mp3", "The bus was full, but the next one was empty.": "audio/cau/cfd981c78ac3d787.mp3", "In the future, cities will have more green spaces.": "audio/cau/a1ba49d0a94f167b.mp3", "We can't change the past, but we can change the future.": "audio/cau/3541478809f66efb.mp3", "The word 'garden' starts with the letter G.": "audio/cau/855344adad6266b6.mp3", "Please write a capital G on the board.": "audio/cau/090b2d929a80461a.mp3", "Fill in each gap with a word from the box.": "audio/cau/afa644b720499eae.mp3", "Read the sentence, then fill the gap with the right word.": "audio/cau/1c138053d1f45bdd.mp3", "He is a real gentleman.": "audio/cau/ba0cc3c1615a31fc.mp3", "A gentleman helped me carry my bag.": "audio/cau/356aa6cf79c81bb1.mp3", "I get up at six o'clock every day.": "audio/cau/0449db3f3777d108.mp3", "Mi got a letter from her pen friend yesterday.": "audio/cau/84f62d6a67e5f9cb.mp3", "The girl in the red dress is my sister.": "audio/cau/5c0a090c7edf82c5.mp3", "There are fifteen girls and twenty boys in my class.": "audio/cau/6f902e1712b320f2.mp3", "The girls are playing badminton.": "audio/cau/52ee8ca04fd9a936.mp3", "One girl wears glasses, and the other girls don't.": "audio/cau/b79f88c94a17e5cf.mp3", "Please give me your notebook.": "audio/cau/63fd3e27b3248933.mp3", "Hoa gives her mum flowers; yesterday she gave her a card.": "audio/cau/8a999a2635280ba0.mp3", "Lan finishes her project within the given time.": "audio/cau/e0a4a7e575000b77.mp3", "Our teacher has given us three tasks this week.": "audio/cau/cd0bbafcb1fa540b.mp3", "I go to school by bike.": "audio/cau/df5dcef1ab40916f.mp3", "We often go to the beach; last summer we went to Nha Trang.": "audio/cau/9dac5f396b6a209e.mp3", "Mum has gone to the market.": "audio/cau/85901dafd6c6e677.mp3", "The rain has gone.": "audio/cau/42856535a7f42416.mp3", "Nam is good at maths.": "audio/cau/4fd3587c745c05a2.mp3", "Lan's English is good, but Mi's is better.": "audio/cau/d371c25a8502dc92.mp3", "My goodness! It's so hot today.": "audio/cau/262b2c15cb0e80ce.mp3", "She helped us out of goodness.": "audio/cau/68406886afe46623.mp3", "I got stuck in a traffic jam and came home late.": "audio/cau/fffb27ec64b971e2.mp3", "Mi usually gets up at six, but today she got up at seven.": "audio/cau/787111ee3d018017.mp3", "My grandma tells us stories every night.": "audio/cau/96809300e183923c.mp3", "Grandma and Grandpa live with us.": "audio/cau/8051252f03d98b36.mp3", "My grandmother makes conical hats by hand.": "audio/cau/fb6599cb79d9916d.mp3", "Lan calls her grandmother 'Grandma'.": "audio/cau/61992d8dfda62651.mp3", "My grandparents live in the countryside.": "audio/cau/14d9858e971da542.mp3", "Minh visits his grandparents; his grandfather has a farm.": "audio/cau/ff809b7d116e870e.mp3", "That's a great idea for our project!": "audio/cau/a54aafc7aa505f92.mp3", "We had a great time; the trip was wonderful.": "audio/cau/3dc3e9c44a5960ce.mp3", "She greeted us with a smile.": "audio/cau/338e9fecbc35370b.mp3", "The students greeted their teacher.": "audio/cau/99733cea640fc0a6.mp3", "Each group has four members.": "audio/cau/6db9bb96270db26c.mp3", "Work in groups and report your group's findings.": "audio/cau/dd390edb36c261a2.mp3", "The teacher puts us into groups of five.": "audio/cau/ec8808da410c34e5.mp3", "Our class has six groups, and each group has six students.": "audio/cau/0f693c5a4478ab4f.mp3", "We had a great time at the camp.": "audio/cau/9119cf6bce83ae88.mp3", "I have breakfast at six, but yesterday I had it late.": "audio/cau/8a0bd1bf7d672961.mp3", "Raise your hand if you know the answer.": "audio/cau/70fad8908990bbee.mp3", "My grandma makes paper fans by hand.": "audio/cau/a8edd4bbd084c63c.mp3", "A conical hat is a famous handicraft of Hue.": "audio/cau/849e973e8c7917d5.mp3", "Pottery is a handicraft that people make by hand.": "audio/cau/dafd8b8197d1c2a9.mp3", "My grandma gave me a handmade scarf.": "audio/cau/c6d4f83ec20b3c4c.mp3", "Bat Trang is famous for handmade pottery.": "audio/cau/6a729478c560c0d3.mp3", "Traffic jams often happen at rush hour.": "audio/cau/8ca78ac3c5533334.mp3", "What happened to Nam yesterday?": "audio/cau/a0d18350a2c16ccf.mp3", "Look! What is happening outside?": "audio/cau/59242348e6abfc72.mp3", "Many things happen here, and something is happening now.": "audio/cau/6596b4e4a092c479.mp3", "The maths test was very hard.": "audio/cau/0fd61471858155e3.mp3", "Minh works hard; he is a hardworking student.": "audio/cau/32c549e4a9f6fc13.mp3", "I could hardly hear the teacher.": "audio/cau/144fb5f35860f6c9.mp3", "He hardly ever eats vegetables.": "audio/cau/2dbec027597d3ff1.mp3", "Lan is a hardworking student.": "audio/cau/5b3ff11d5293f4e5.mp3", "Nam is hardworking, and he never gets lazy.": "audio/cau/06cd2484f9437f49.mp3", "Lan has two brothers.": "audio/cau/3ee04272e80b66c1.mp3", "Nam has a new bike; he had an old one before.": "audio/cau/756f69898700b7f4.mp3", "I hate waiting for the bus in the rain.": "audio/cau/3f99a8ce5b4ab56c.mp3", "Nam likes city life, but he hates traffic jams.": "audio/cau/6300158d6a0d3117.mp3", "I have a cat and a dog.": "audio/cau/3942c510ddf250d4.mp3", "We have English today, and we had Maths yesterday.": "audio/cau/f53b658e1d0dc09e.mp3", "We are having lunch in the canteen.": "audio/cau/68be2432f9d1c150.mp3", "Lan is having fun because she has many friends here.": "audio/cau/955a8fc5bad8bd17.mp3", "We turn on the heater in winter.": "audio/cau/97b6d2a218e566ca.mp3", "The water heater is broken.": "audio/cau/3923709391d2f3ac.mp3", "It rained heavily last night.": "audio/cau/1a3ae2881e3af6a8.mp3", "The city is heavily polluted.": "audio/cau/30feb15789eaf8ce.mp3", "This box is too heavy for me.": "audio/cau/ac63962a8602519b.mp3", "Heavy rain causes floods, and the traffic gets heavier.": "audio/cau/7da989b969861a4f.mp3", "Can you help me with my homework?": "audio/cau/59064ec1f34486d3.mp3", "Mi is helpful; she always helps her mum cook.": "audio/cau/82b6e08d58022ab1.mp3", "A street cleaner is a community helper.": "audio/cau/4e5627311f32688c.mp3", "The helper always helps old people cross the road.": "audio/cau/5d453af4870fad09.mp3", "The map is very helpful for tourists.": "audio/cau/01dfa6b6d0d2dc96.mp3", "Mi is helpful; she often helps her neighbours.": "audio/cau/28366edc55c3b71c.mp3", "Let's play hide-and-seek!": "audio/cau/92bdf95ba8e2006c.mp3", "Where did you hide the key?": "audio/cau/353d0b3791179764.mp3", "I go home at five o'clock.": "audio/cau/a74ab800c921a80b.mp3", "After school, Mi does her homework at home.": "audio/cau/ecaf6456acc0b85d.mp3", "I felt homesick on my first day at camp.": "audio/cau/4d3a402933ae59e2.mp3", "Students studying abroad often feel homesick.": "audio/cau/ea48648e9a7d5f77.mp3", "Nam does his homework at home every evening.": "audio/cau/0c529025b7e7c4aa.mp3", "I hope we will arrive at the city square in time.": "audio/cau/4cf4b919d975b51c.mp3", "Mi is hopeful; she hopes to pass the exam.": "audio/cau/b10ada31860f43ff.mp3", "We are hopeful about the future.": "audio/cau/a7f4ae7a6bf43e95.mp3", "She is hopeful that she will pass.": "audio/cau/4f22f41caccff88f.mp3", "Hopefully, it will be sunny tomorrow.": "audio/cau/68cf1245c287731d.mp3", "Hopefully, I can visit you next week.": "audio/cau/d64b99261d38e74d.mp3", "I'm hopeless at drawing.": "audio/cau/fc641817792db467.mp3", "Don't feel hopeless; try again.": "audio/cau/e090d59a3e8b06b6.mp3", "In the hot sun, he is always at the school gate.": "audio/cau/d94f7911dc61672f.mp3", "The heat is terrible today; it's so hot!": "audio/cau/15a129bda3aabffd.mp3", "He was poor. However, he never gave up.": "audio/cau/893555bad2aff789.mp3", "It rained. However, Nam still went to school, but late.": "audio/cau/97115d20f691f7e4.mp3", "Children are very imaginative.": "audio/cau/b79c2430e0adaf24.mp3", "She wrote an imaginative story.": "audio/cau/313d8314337fb59d.mp3", "We talked about the importance of local crafts.": "audio/cau/1dd1fbbbd5db7ba1.mp3", "Sleep is important; we all know its importance.": "audio/cau/39fdef6a24182eb1.mp3", "It is important to keep our streets clean.": "audio/cau/4541b30fbeb1b8aa.mp3", "Reading is important; never forget its importance.": "audio/cau/0b2b91b8a69bb8c9.mp3", "More importantly, we must save water.": "audio/cau/09a367b8deac295f.mp3", "Most importantly, be kind to others.": "audio/cau/8709c00d7d3b3af1.mp3", "His inability to swim worried his mum.": "audio/cau/ceac75040d39fda2.mp3", "Some people have an inability to focus.": "audio/cau/d5900ab9459091c6.mp3", "Shorts are inappropriate at the pagoda.": "audio/cau/79b8379f0b856789.mp3", "Some online videos are inappropriate for kids.": "audio/cau/ad2eeaa14a1408ce.mp3", "He was dressed inappropriately for the party.": "audio/cau/a4e8ac562544333b.mp3", "Don't behave inappropriately in class.": "audio/cau/1c5e836514f0be8b.mp3", "Your homework is incomplete.": "audio/cau/1def1df8007e7413.mp3", "Complete the incomplete sentences.": "audio/cau/865265a2ff56d7b1.mp3", "Correct the incorrect sentences.": "audio/cau/0fa204f88cc856c0.mp3", "Your answer is incorrect, so please correct it.": "audio/cau/2d6a22f249708653.mp3", "It's raining, so let's play indoors.": "audio/cau/04169f48e9b079ef.mp3", "Children spend too much time indoors.": "audio/cau/8fef709df2f5dd51.mp3", "It's raining. Let's play inside.": "audio/cau/a8fe3fe27e17a1ac.mp3", "Lan opens the door and goes inside.": "audio/cau/1c88017fec65bbcc.mp3", "My mum insisted on driving me to school.": "audio/cau/482faf63de1a5944.mp3", "He insisted that he was right.": "audio/cau/9acdf8113dbff54d.mp3", "Music is his greatest interest.": "audio/cau/01ea6b9ecb917ed3.mp3", "Minh has an interest in history, so he is interested in museums.": "audio/cau/218a4f41f5587ba6.mp3", "She was interested in science from an early age.": "audio/cau/34d48dff42b1323f.mp3", "Lan is interested in the book because it is interesting.": "audio/cau/916ab5cb0684d54c.mp3", "City life is interesting but stressful.": "audio/cau/d3da66e08dd099e1.mp3", "The film is interesting, and everyone is interested in it.": "audio/cau/4a91c463480dae58.mp3", "Listen and repeat with the correct intonation.": "audio/cau/fb6df2aa95963ff8.mp3", "Yes/No questions have rising intonation.": "audio/cau/30f8bae887c2fa64.mp3", "My school is big and beautiful.": "audio/cau/d5765e25cafa0eea.mp3", "Today it is sunny, but yesterday it was rainy.": "audio/cau/ed1bcaf6501bfd0c.mp3", "My father has a job in a hospital.": "audio/cau/5bbe212d5f4f6b36.mp3", "Good job, Mi! You finished your work early.": "audio/cau/1fb5d09e0e0e0c1f.mp3", "Minh finished his project just before the due date.": "audio/cau/6a8c8ece8bd3699e.mp3", "Hoa arrived just before the test started.": "audio/cau/ddc502e35be5489a.mp3", "The word 'kitchen' starts with the letter k.": "audio/cau/ac85fdd0f3c32f82.mp3", "Please write a capital K on the board.": "audio/cau/f5d61da2bd65aeef.mp3", "It's a perfect present for kids aged between 10 and 15.": "audio/cau/0a1ccb836dfdb1d4.mp3", "The kids play in the park; children love it.": "audio/cau/30844ad30dbeea3e.mp3", "My teacher is very kind.": "audio/cau/a4408f8940b23d7a.mp3", "Hoa is kind to everyone, but her brother is sometimes unkind.": "audio/cau/92eef49a76085d2d.mp3", "Uncle Ho is known and loved by all Vietnamese people.": "audio/cau/e714527fbec233eb.mp3", "Many people know him; he is well known in Viet Nam.": "audio/cau/ea446edd847c7b43.mp3", "The word 'lamp' starts with the letter l.": "audio/cau/c5e08a5413a4f66b.mp3", "Please write a capital L on the board.": "audio/cau/63173cda63a08912.mp3", "A lady showed me the way to the bus station.": "audio/cau/34c3b7d031f2d59f.mp3", "The lady and the gentleman are my neighbours.": "audio/cau/0c255a6ade395228.mp3", "My house has a large garden.": "audio/cau/aca5eaaef305eea5.mp3", "Their house is large, and their garden is very big.": "audio/cau/58f11bb60767bcfb.mp3", "I visited my grandparents last weekend.": "audio/cau/553e8bea75bbdbbd.mp3", "Last Sunday was fun, and next Sunday will be fun too.": "audio/cau/17be93822cc3c397.mp3", "Don't be late for school!": "audio/cau/2de1bb7c8bcc4ad3.mp3", "Mi was late, but Nam came early.": "audio/cau/1f3ff224e4611670.mp3", "Have you seen any good films lately?": "audio/cau/6662895672bc9308.mp3", "It has been very hot lately.": "audio/cau/cdeb95250d02997e.mp3", "Later, he became a famous doctor.": "audio/cau/07a3d83c155c22a7.mp3", "I was late; I'll call you later.": "audio/cau/48c24516af887381.mp3", "Don't be lazy; do your homework.": "audio/cau/e8cd1ea0644d6fc1.mp3", "My cat is lazy and sleeps all day.": "audio/cau/fc1756a55ab83842.mp3", "We learn English at school.": "audio/cau/9bc26f3d76057248.mp3", "Nam wants to learn to swim, and his sister learnt last year.": "audio/cau/5a7392296080d626.mp3", "She is a fast learner.": "audio/cau/bdda689dc68ad8a3.mp3", "This book is for English learners.": "audio/cau/5aa493db6a382d2e.mp3", "I learnt a new song today.": "audio/cau/002dc8ba978f437b.mp3", "Mi likes to learn new words; yesterday she learnt ten.": "audio/cau/01afc6c13b541caf.mp3", "He had to leave school at the age of fifteen.": "audio/cau/0036ab8cf9a331c5.mp3", "We leave home at six; yesterday we left at seven.": "audio/cau/d3d9e5743a9b9bd0.mp3", "Village life is less noisy than city life.": "audio/cau/00a225b39b028bcc.mp3", "I have little time, less than Mi; Nam has the least.": "audio/cau/310826397361a2bd.mp3", "He had a difficult life when he was young.": "audio/cau/0e2c7b87c896e8b7.mp3", "City life is busy, and people live very fast.": "audio/cau/c7a56b97906b19d2.mp3", "Stop when the traffic light is red.": "audio/cau/dd4921089bcbaa08.mp3", "Turn on the light, please; the room is dark.": "audio/cau/dd20920a13027c13.mp3", "I like noodles very much.": "audio/cau/7557928354c11c4a.mp3", "I like cats, but I dislike spiders.": "audio/cau/bdd9c25c87fbc823.mp3", "Minh likes playing football.": "audio/cau/8b21f729dbeb8632.mp3", "Hoa likes music, but I like art.": "audio/cau/e9144dc6f8053afb.mp3", "Which line comes after 'We're playing together'?": "audio/cau/ad977311b8dcbfd2.mp3", "Read the first line of the chant aloud.": "audio/cau/36ef301fe6cfba19.mp3", "Please listen to Lan's life story carefully.": "audio/cau/5e66ffcca03d62ba.mp3", "Minh is a good listener; he always listens to his friends.": "audio/cau/2a4b1d64993cd32a.mp3", "My mum is a good listener.": "audio/cau/c361fe2d103db23c.mp3", "The radio programme has many listeners.": "audio/cau/95723f87c574336f.mp3", "The singer thanked her listeners.": "audio/cau/614b2e699fe48683.mp3", "Good listeners don't interrupt.": "audio/cau/c3b755ce42d0958f.mp3", "Thank you for listening.": "audio/cau/ee26d140bc752b99.mp3", "Nam is listening to music; he loves to listen to pop songs.": "audio/cau/8451afe66a0bd788.mp3", "My little brother is five years old.": "audio/cau/e22af4e6bb3d77f0.mp3", "I have a little money, but my sister has less.": "audio/cau/520fdc680c743ed9.mp3", "We live in a small village.": "audio/cau/8438d091662da029.mp3", "My grandparents live in the countryside and have a happy life.": "audio/cau/a21ec63c6b42bc8d.mp3", "Ho Chi Minh City is very lively at night.": "audio/cau/f7f9de50246fc30a.mp3", "The market is lively and busy in the morning.": "audio/cau/be87297ba2d5a7fc.mp3", "There is a big sofa in the living room.": "audio/cau/85ee341c5ccef3a3.mp3", "We live in a small house with a nice living room.": "audio/cau/a4537e161135cc8a.mp3", "Mai has a lot of friends at school.": "audio/cau/5010f52a3a68ba0b.mp3", "Minh reads a lot, and he has lots of books.": "audio/cau/356256a0d64c06ca.mp3", "There are lots of books in our school library.": "audio/cau/3190c7d803a13870.mp3", "Phong has lots of friends and a lot of free time.": "audio/cau/4a66fae37e042e36.mp3", "I love my family.": "audio/cau/02c5061798cc56cc.mp3", "My grandma is loving, and I love her a lot.": "audio/cau/588e4f5967e2076b.mp3", "What a lovely day!": "audio/cau/d4038241635895d6.mp3", "Her little sister is lovely.": "audio/cau/2566ff2d6fc065b2.mp3", "My mother is a loving person.": "audio/cau/5a0aadfbccb5dec1.mp3", "Hoa has a loving family, and she loves them a lot.": "audio/cau/dbfb0082905aad2d.mp3", "The price of this book is low.": "audio/cau/0a550bb977c74722.mp3", "The wall is very low.": "audio/cau/e9866ca6574d7e65.mp3", "I'm a student at Nguyen Du High School.": "audio/cau/fc4e40becc452649.mp3", "I'm happy because I am with my best friends.": "audio/cau/70dc61c954d001ef.mp3", "He made his first computer in a small garage.": "audio/cau/ab57132318aeca10.mp3", "This vase is made of clay; people make it in Bat Trang.": "audio/cau/e23523961a9ed154.mp3", "Hard work can make your dreams come true.": "audio/cau/b31d6220b696ab85.mp3", "He made many mistakes, but he learnt to make good choices.": "audio/cau/f95abe45aba09ae8.mp3", "He is a famous film maker.": "audio/cau/68e4b5c408bfa483.mp3", "My uncle is a furniture maker.": "audio/cau/177cfe96f7f1bf13.mp3", "My mother makes spring rolls at Tet.": "audio/cau/c6bb3a72ed840478.mp3", "Mi makes a cake today; yesterday she made cookies.": "audio/cau/eaa71b7044b2e690.mp3", "Mai is making a birthday card for Lan.": "audio/cau/dc70bb88704df4a4.mp3", "We are making paper flowers; we made ten yesterday.": "audio/cau/2de37c2668104819.mp3", "We have our exams in May.": "audio/cau/596706c87a49f74e.mp3", "May is a hot month in the south.": "audio/cau/a0fc44757a99e818.mp3", "The MC of the show is very funny.": "audio/cau/77fef4477679a6c8.mp3", "She wants to be a TV MC.": "audio/cau/0081d806aca3cd93.mp3", "Every family member helps with the housework.": "audio/cau/8fa1a66c09c2ea18.mp3", "Mai is a member of the club, and membership is free.": "audio/cau/01456e371fd4ed8a.mp3", "There are five members in my family.": "audio/cau/9c7f5da2602fbde9.mp3", "Nam is a member of the art club, which has twenty members.": "audio/cau/e6038ee727214445.mp3", "Club membership is free for students.": "audio/cau/ae8e8efa3939377b.mp3", "I have a library membership card.": "audio/cau/11c3d535f525e9b3.mp3", "Please don't misunderstand me.": "audio/cau/913575a433273816.mp3", "People often misunderstand this word.": "audio/cau/d26a103ea1d3f9ec.mp3", "I get up at six every morning.": "audio/cau/838c5da1aad62be2.mp3", "We study in the morning and play in the evening.": "audio/cau/8a176d8289d946ce.mp3", "My mother is a nurse.": "audio/cau/7504a7ce3f463355.mp3", "Mi's mother, her mum, cooks very well.": "audio/cau/4860342249a4a0b1.mp3", "My mum works in a hospital.": "audio/cau/6797efc1f7e404e7.mp3", "I love my mum; she is a kind mother.": "audio/cau/9c8b3cd7b9c8ebfc.mp3", "In 'running', we double the letter n.": "audio/cau/f2d3227ba2e63feb.mp3", "Run ends in n, so we write running with two n's.": "audio/cau/840a0ecac7ac2b05.mp3", "Just smile and act naturally.": "audio/cau/c323a8d0d8b79bc9.mp3", "These flowers grow naturally here.": "audio/cau/135f26cf5c3ad7b3.mp3", "Is it necessary to wear a helmet?": "audio/cau/310488fddb9b7077.mp3", "Water is necessary for life; it is a basic necessity.": "audio/cau/1c5a7a36e7e8db29.mp3", "We need more parks in the city.": "audio/cau/fa790aed3aa20742.mp3", "Plants need water, and Mi needs some help.": "audio/cau/43af483482c3e17f.mp3", "If I have all the needed ingredients, I can make a delicious pizza.": "audio/cau/b8863fe0f2752a65.mp3", "Hoa brings all the needed books to class.": "audio/cau/8b00a387319795d2.mp3", "The village needs a new bridge.": "audio/cau/1beac53452ba3355.mp3", "Nam needs a pen, and I need one too.": "audio/cau/bd84b90357a9da88.mp3", "Nam feels nervous before exams.": "audio/cau/dd8456cf6721dfe8.mp3", "Don't be nervous. You can do it!": "audio/cau/a44a3cfdc9f742bc.mp3", "She never gave up her dream.": "audio/cau/b95a5dea82e7f24d.mp3", "Never give up; always try your best.": "audio/cau/45044467beb1d1bf.mp3", "Nice to meet you, Mai.": "audio/cau/7c4c4da145e9a59d.mp3", "Lan is nice, and she always speaks nicely.": "audio/cau/b93deacf2eeac62d.mp3", "The city is noisy at night.": "audio/cau/003950b6dbcd9d77.mp3", "We went out last night, so tonight we stay at home.": "audio/cau/334224d67553dca2.mp3", "Ho Chi Minh City has an exciting nightlife.": "audio/cau/db63b206001cd606.mp3", "The nightlife here is lively, and the streets are busy at night.": "audio/cau/3d60979904eca10a.mp3", "She did not give up her dream.": "audio/cau/b5d39e3052bc5fbb.mp3", "I am not tired, and I'm not hungry.": "audio/cau/9485504d93b05a38.mp3", "I am doing my homework now.": "audio/cau/c512289bbb165978.mp3", "It is raining now, so we stay at home.": "audio/cau/ac1b5a1cae28deb6.mp3", "I occasionally eat fast food.": "audio/cau/145b01299e44929f.mp3", "We occasionally visit our aunt.": "audio/cau/01d600ad07015fee.mp3", "Floods often occur in the rainy season.": "audio/cau/f8aefec57bda432c.mp3", "When did the accident occur?": "audio/cau/e1b4fef7ca096494.mp3", "Turn off the lights when you leave.": "audio/cau/3a68f3ab6e248006.mp3", "Turn on the fan, but turn off the TV.": "audio/cau/bdd957c99adde5f0.mp3", "I often get up at six o'clock.": "audio/cau/08008a46175a2d25.mp3", "Minh often reads books, but he never plays games.": "audio/cau/a29cadde346ad9ba.mp3", "My grandfather is seventy years old.": "audio/cau/ad4ec0973ce447a3.mp3", "My bike is old, but my sister's bike is new.": "audio/cau/dc292ece9d402a3f.mp3", "Our school organised a book fair.": "audio/cau/b8e5335267df2055.mp3", "She is a very organised student.": "audio/cau/78dd6fbd6335576d.mp3", "Mi went out with her friends last night.": "audio/cau/6662db3eac9ce4e0.mp3", "Nam wants to find out more about his grandfather's life.": "audio/cau/c2c4b3120ecb6468.mp3", "She is an outstanding student.": "audio/cau/114d138533e97e0b.mp3", "The team gave an outstanding performance.": "audio/cau/30f6882f94f7003e.mp3", "Don't overestimate your skills.": "audio/cau/ac57decc9ffcfdc1.mp3", "We overestimated the time we needed.": "audio/cau/8771bd54b0914157.mp3", "She started her own business at the age of 25.": "audio/cau/6b63e0d466da083a.mp3", "Lan has her own bike, and her dad owns a shop.": "audio/cau/3e685e99b02109d7.mp3", "Who is the owner of this bag?": "audio/cau/267db4164d6de47a.mp3", "Mi is the owner of the blue bike.": "audio/cau/6fd99520869ed0ff.mp3", "The film starts at 8 p.m.": "audio/cau/5b3d11f7cb5bec98.mp3", "School finishes at 4.30 p.m., and I have dinner at 7 p.m.": "audio/cau/6193e0ae396e4d78.mp3", "My dad paid for the tickets.": "audio/cau/b4014cbad8c7d1da.mp3", "I paid 20,000 dong for the book.": "audio/cau/5359db2d26ba3bf6.mp3", "My broken arm is very painful.": "audio/cau/7d1d1aa03ebd5a46.mp3", "Saying goodbye is painful.": "audio/cau/4284ae83a5179aa8.mp3", "I need a new pair of shoes for school.": "audio/cau/250c1c4ccfb0d448.mp3", "Find a partner and work in pairs.": "audio/cau/9f9cc8d6f86e7886.mp3", "Work in pairs and ask each other questions.": "audio/cau/2bae203d74ef1339.mp3", "There are ten pairs, so each pair gets one card.": "audio/cau/6a0e4948c63a816b.mp3", "Every parent loves their children.": "audio/cau/f0f02e141cda079d.mp3", "My mum is a kind parent.": "audio/cau/fc0100e2293df4cc.mp3", "This app has parental controls.": "audio/cau/8a73f889c7960108.mp3", "Children need parental love.": "audio/cau/74f6bcb6352c58be.mp3", "Use the words in parentheses.": "audio/cau/c654b42b83e8fb4f.mp3", "Put the verbs in parentheses in the correct form.": "audio/cau/5c76924820458187.mp3", "My parents are always kind and patient.": "audio/cau/f70296736693e0b8.mp3", "My dad is a busy parent, but my parents always eat dinner with us.": "audio/cau/02cfa7df92c1de83.mp3", "This part of the lesson is about friends.": "audio/cau/fe137d473624dc0c.mp3", "We take part in the game, and it is partly about music.": "audio/cau/f86fd833e90206a2.mp3", "It will be partly cloudy tomorrow.": "audio/cau/2e9279ced890cd59.mp3", "The story is partly true.": "audio/cau/a56a321d8dcb3386.mp3", "The lesson has three parts.": "audio/cau/1b1d9c097e2f0ab4.mp3", "Name the parts of the face: eyes, nose and mouth.": "audio/cau/1959d4fcb37c5b1b.mp3", "Read the passage and answer the questions.": "audio/cau/9a3c0d57d2e7ee93.mp3", "This passage is about Tet.": "audio/cau/6d3bf3c7448a33f3.mp3", "Reading and drawing are my passions.": "audio/cau/8804c27f8dd74581.mp3", "Follow your passions.": "audio/cau/b77e9f1b377e142c.mp3", "In the past, people wrote letters by hand.": "audio/cau/89dfbd0ce69e6ac3.mp3", "Learn from the past and plan for the future.": "audio/cau/11c99eed5de3f605.mp3", "The park has many paths.": "audio/cau/35513897e7a8dccf.mp3", "Keep the paths clean.": "audio/cau/892235b74a64558e.mp3", "There are five people in my family.": "audio/cau/61d24a117613907d.mp3", "One person is late, but the other people are here.": "audio/cau/b4e5b7ba18b09096.mp3", "The police protect people's lives and property.": "audio/cau/a0a5f9e15b6f2ecc.mp3", "Each person has a dream, and people's dreams are different.": "audio/cau/5ac1723fa647cbb7.mp3", "He is a kind and hard-working person.": "audio/cau/a7cc8ccdfee48d42.mp3", "One person came first, then many people came.": "audio/cau/e2f7a3bc001f7fc0.mp3", "This is my personal diary.": "audio/cau/4bb512632de09306.mp3", "Don't share personal information online.": "audio/cau/e4de8d484708e9e5.mp3", "Can you take a photo of us?": "audio/cau/4e7337681afc841a.mp3", "This photo is a nice picture of my class.": "audio/cau/94f608c9dc656d2b.mp3", "My uncle is a photographer.": "audio/cau/84945e0c05f98e38.mp3", "The photographer took many pictures.": "audio/cau/78c35f6d244bab0b.mp3", "Look at the photos of my friends.": "audio/cau/8a988a56d17dddc5.mp3", "Mi takes a photo, and Lan takes many photos.": "audio/cau/df1811e9acc25b9a.mp3", "'Look after' is a phrasal verb.": "audio/cau/af602eb955e2891a.mp3", "Learn each phrase and use the phrasal verbs in sentences.": "audio/cau/40a96f6869b52557.mp3", "Match each phrase with its meaning.": "audio/cau/557dd9e0b36c6f5f.mp3", "'Go out' is a phrasal verb, and 'in the city' is a phrase.": "audio/cau/ca722714e28c9b92.mp3", "Use these phrases in your presentation.": "audio/cau/4f40d1db291eb325.mp3", "Write one phrase from the box, then add two more phrases.": "audio/cau/f53433a3dd4c0563.mp3", "Pick a card, please.": "audio/cau/1e4e9d51e347aede.mp3", "We pick tea leaves in the morning.": "audio/cau/c487a2bfd0d8d890.mp3", "Mi draws beautiful pictures in art class.": "audio/cau/1037e2e30ff7fb85.mp3", "We took many photos and put the pictures on the wall.": "audio/cau/5ddc63bf192b9304.mp3", "This is a nice place to live.": "audio/cau/160e9180eaed0aee.mp3", "Let's meet at the usual place after school.": "audio/cau/f760c0b8e65d51b8.mp3", "We need a plan for our project.": "audio/cau/e33a8fe9fb341903.mp3", "Nam planned his trip carefully with his family.": "audio/cau/f61c169a10484b3b.mp3", "He was born into a poor family.": "audio/cau/f960f9dc0b1abeb6.mp3", "She helped poor children and fought against poverty.": "audio/cau/f7b2c8475fadd81a.mp3", "He did poorly in the test.": "audio/cau/51e24443f26d9b60.mp3", "The room is poorly lit.": "audio/cau/3ed6154138f594ae.mp3", "This singer is popular with teenagers.": "audio/cau/fdbd5fd7ebddf922.mp3", "Football is the most popular sport in Viet Nam.": "audio/cau/a567791eb72955db.mp3", "The game's popularity is growing.": "audio/cau/126119d057896ab4.mp3", "K-pop has great popularity in Vietnam.": "audio/cau/edcc5616984001a4.mp3", "I send letters at the post office.": "audio/cau/c83826aeb2d3831a.mp3", "The postman brings the post every morning.": "audio/cau/244a41f683ba46de.mp3", "Our group made a poster about a famous person.": "audio/cau/8348c433367a56fb.mp3", "Put the poster on the classroom wall.": "audio/cau/3cb69d89d136b6e0.mp3", "Many families live in poverty.": "audio/cau/03ed146088ddeeee.mp3", "Education can help end poverty.": "audio/cau/f651e512292aacdb.mp3", "Football practice is on Saturday morning.": "audio/cau/6494d311fac68397.mp3", "We practise English every day because practice makes perfect.": "audio/cau/41b3647f667733f3.mp3", "Good preparation helps you pass the exam.": "audio/cau/b4ceb37a596fa919.mp3", "Tet preparation takes a long time.": "audio/cau/55a2bf2f74de18c9.mp3", "I prepare my schoolbag every evening.": "audio/cau/71ebd7177f9dc1f3.mp3", "Preparation is important, so we prepare for the test carefully.": "audio/cau/3c4561b5af8ea83d.mp3", "Many teens like street food more than food prepared at home.": "audio/cau/6d55de4036adf579.mp3", "We prepared a short talk about our city.": "audio/cau/086e339f2e3d6d8a.mp3", "Each group will present their project to the class.": "audio/cau/6116c3864aebd817.mp3", "Hoa presented her project about her grandfather.": "audio/cau/199806383df2605a.mp3", "Our group gave a presentation about a famous person.": "audio/cau/19eabc250c35918d.mp3", "Minh presents the first part of the presentation.": "audio/cau/97ffec456b1ba8a6.mp3", "She is a TV presenter.": "audio/cau/12a3eb4b246723e1.mp3", "The presenter asked many questions.": "audio/cau/cf8a5c5982b7bec0.mp3", "Making silk is a long process.": "audio/cau/ad6acbda53bc3a2e.mp3", "Learn each step of the process of making pottery.": "audio/cau/8067551c57820f4a.mp3", "My computer has many programs.": "audio/cau/8943db831dbd507a.mp3", "He writes programs for phones.": "audio/cau/5930ed111ce8d35e.mp3", "Our group is doing a project about a famous person.": "audio/cau/c9daf131fff9ae9e.mp3", "We show our project on the projector.": "audio/cau/268ba89e01254eff.mp3", "The teacher uses a projector in class.": "audio/cau/bf7a5b7d233e514f.mp3", "Turn on the projector, please.": "audio/cau/bd14a2766f89d167.mp3", "We should put rubbish in the bins properly.": "audio/cau/4b452bfb8062fc18.mp3", "Tidy your room properly before you go out.": "audio/cau/843d9f284359665b.mp3", "Put your books on the desk.": "audio/cau/2d454633026296cc.mp3", "Yesterday I put my bike in the garage.": "audio/cau/4337fe6ef9062f07.mp3", "Kindness is one of her best qualities.": "audio/cau/8caea7d9d325d1c4.mp3", "What qualities does a good leader need?": "audio/cau/24c4cd71ee97c4c5.mp3", "Can I ask you a question, Ms Hoa?": "audio/cau/7e99e348210556f2.mp3", "Nam asks a question, and Mi gives the answer.": "audio/cau/269c53bfb0db8e6f.mp3", "Please fill in the questionnaire.": "audio/cau/a95121e3928b213d.mp3", "We did a questionnaire about hobbies.": "audio/cau/c390090db32f59d5.mp3", "The teacher asks us three questions.": "audio/cau/9e7c27a7a37e13a0.mp3", "Read the questions carefully and write your answers.": "audio/cau/7fcc03272c2a6124.mp3", "The word 'red' starts with the letter r.": "audio/cau/19d12f34975f740f.mp3", "'Rabbit' and 'room' both begin with R.": "audio/cau/aca28cd4f322eeb4.mp3", "The rain helps the plants grow.": "audio/cau/dcb6145c778bef36.mp3", "It is rainy today, so take an umbrella.": "audio/cau/10a2647a630c9236.mp3", "The area has heavy rainfall in summer.": "audio/cau/db56feb620e08e0a.mp3", "Rainfall is low in the desert.": "audio/cau/6d52d9afa01f4839.mp3", "It's a rainy day today.": "audio/cau/7487252f9ed5b9ee.mp3", "The rainy season starts in May.": "audio/cau/041cbb54abf51c95.mp3", "I rarely go to the cinema.": "audio/cau/665f28d3968d7eec.mp3", "Snow is rare in Ha Noi, so we rarely see it.": "audio/cau/651a9aa109c5d5ab.mp3", "I read a book before bed every night.": "audio/cau/52f4120305948c56.mp3", "Yesterday Mi read a story, because reading is her hobby.": "audio/cau/a206c7fecbd29a47.mp3", "My sister is a fast reader.": "audio/cau/c997b3414e90f2e3.mp3", "Lan is a good reader because she reads every day.": "audio/cau/804882ef0e352a60.mp3", "Reading helps us learn new words.": "audio/cau/a36b0142402545f6.mp3", "I read a story last night, and it was great.": "audio/cau/67941e0da7d7be3c.mp3", "Is this a real flower?": "audio/cau/c4352f757425274a.mp3", "He is my real friend.": "audio/cau/9c27c75ea3fb5cf0.mp3", "In reality, life in the city is very busy.": "audio/cau/2307696ecf8fe88c.mp3", "My future city has virtual reality cinemas.": "audio/cau/99d86b4ac662f01a.mp3", "My new friend is really kind.": "audio/cau/abe28633dc1304c0.mp3", "Is this a real photo? Yes, it's really from Ha Long Bay.": "audio/cau/a28021fb9066cf49.mp3", "Give one reason why you like your friend.": "audio/cau/a3f79369c8db7055.mp3", "The price is reasonable, and that is my reason for buying it.": "audio/cau/f927cd67a281473b.mp3", "The prices here are reasonable.": "audio/cau/ae60767c664ffa40.mp3", "That's a reasonable idea.": "audio/cau/a58450244623d611.mp3", "There are many reasons to make new friends.": "audio/cau/b4aec367cd011148.mp3", "Write two reasons, and explain each reason.": "audio/cau/0e00874bd41b6407.mp3", "It's OK to refuse help politely.": "audio/cau/ecf4198cfd3d8fed.mp3", "Mi accepted the invitation, but Nam refused it.": "audio/cau/103ce51e84177e62.mp3", "These questions relate to the text.": "audio/cau/5f9d333f7b98fff6.mp3", "I can relate to her story.": "audio/cau/37c2f70ea8b4b0c8.mp3", "Find three words related to life stories.": "audio/cau/a35a94f3c1f834e3.mp3", "These two ideas are related, so connect them.": "audio/cau/cea4243854336025.mp3", "There is a relation between diet and health.": "audio/cau/3aecf0edbede5637.mp3", "Vietnam has good relations with Japan.": "audio/cau/b93cceb92ead539a.mp3", "Mi has a good relationship with her neighbours.": "audio/cau/67664fd4120bb4b4.mp3", "Good relationships make our community stronger.": "audio/cau/28d1b1022fb685d1.mp3", "Walking in the morning makes us feel relaxed.": "audio/cau/8a55a52b63802535.mp3", "Hoa feels relaxed after listening to music.": "audio/cau/a280c4ce5593c872.mp3", "Please remain in your seats.": "audio/cau/a69a901e69682f29.mp3", "The weather will remain hot.": "audio/cau/e5c6ac18b5424f3e.mp3", "The work is repetitive.": "audio/cau/b61343ced873f41a.mp3", "Repetitive exercises help you remember.": "audio/cau/fc9fbaa0a249e931.mp3", "How does Elena reply to her mum?": "audio/cau/dcaf59d7091175e8.mp3", "Please reply to my email soon.": "audio/cau/1fbb259adb0f0a8b.mp3", "This job requires good English.": "audio/cau/0cd7c4762cd2003b.mp3", "Plants require water and light.": "audio/cau/cdcb21caeda3c046.mp3", "The work is required to be completed by Monday.": "audio/cau/70259cf129884641.mp3", "Students are required to wear uniforms.": "audio/cau/218ab214ad50b076.mp3", "Respond to your partner's questions about the story.": "audio/cau/46d3b8c747f8c598.mp3", "Lan responded quickly; her response was very kind.": "audio/cau/dc826eaedcd6a17a.mp3", "I'm waiting for her response.": "audio/cau/16c2d1abf9623229.mp3", "His response was quick.": "audio/cau/435851e3f604b9a0.mp3", "This phone screen is very responsive.": "audio/cau/fc2c8bbc241de5cc.mp3", "The teacher is responsive to our questions.": "audio/cau/ea6415bb3e6a346d.mp3", "We had dinner at a restaurant.": "audio/cau/2d6c0a016ebc69ef.mp3", "This restaurant serves good pho.": "audio/cau/4390ddbb6912136e.mp3", "Traffic jams are a result of too many cars.": "audio/cau/c6f2d4d7dd7fa222.mp3", "Too many cars result in traffic jams.": "audio/cau/80b013bcff4e245c.mp3", "Volunteering is very rewarding.": "audio/cau/2eb8058f2c726c0e.mp3", "Teaching is a rewarding job.": "audio/cau/d09737a86293d23d.mp3", "He is a rich man.": "audio/cau/94ae2901b2b5cb7b.mp3", "Vietnam has a rich culture.": "audio/cau/549692b165e5c98f.mp3", "Your answer is right, Nam.": "audio/cau/de0207c9ebd60141.mp3", "Is this answer right or wrong?": "audio/cau/6f5632fc348cdcbc.mp3", "I sit in the front row.": "audio/cau/e4352dc4f28d944b.mp3", "We rowed a boat on the lake.": "audio/cau/d7142c9e4d6ed7b7.mp3", "She's my best friend in class 6A.": "audio/cau/810592fcf73e04e7.mp3", "This is Vinh's bike, and he's in my class.": "audio/cau/6a8b8131a5222edf.mp3", "I said, can you pass me the book?": "audio/cau/e2db7c41d720581d.mp3", "The teacher said we should sleep early.": "audio/cau/f9528b768b823292.mp3", "Teachers get their salary every month.": "audio/cau/9e66fcd76b337950.mp3", "He has a good salary.": "audio/cau/391d20e1effbab00.mp3", "It is hard to satisfy everyone.": "audio/cau/634a3bb3c4a7a406.mp3", "This big meal will satisfy your hunger.": "audio/cau/dff4a7d18d23b6ba.mp3", "What do you say when you meet someone?": "audio/cau/ebd766cb7a0b37c7.mp3", "Say hello! Mi said hello to everyone.": "audio/cau/835b6b164eec79c4.mp3", "What is the artisan saying about his work?": "audio/cau/758a63f41cdaea82.mp3", "Grandpa said an old saying about hard work.": "audio/cau/dae1465b6bed02a4.mp3", "I put my books in my schoolbag before school.": "audio/cau/c492164eb59da7f4.mp3", "My schoolbag is too heavy today.": "audio/cau/8d0a65c64cf8ce99.mp3", "She puts her books in her schoolbag.": "audio/cau/3f97f32ee71ad86a.mp3", "Select the correct answer A, B or C.": "audio/cau/fa11d36a6784e8b9.mp3", "She selected a red dress for the party.": "audio/cau/949a496976983bca.mp3", "The first semester ends in January.": "audio/cau/6ef4baa104372208.mp3", "This semester we have a big project.": "audio/cau/6216411d0f3f3cda.mp3", "Dogs have a strong sense of smell.": "audio/cau/cbe7255946f6c96a.mp3", "She has a good sense of humour.": "audio/cau/2669cd8c65974462.mp3", "Write a sentence about your family.": "audio/cau/9ffdb94eb27ae024.mp3", "This sentence is short and easy to read.": "audio/cau/f99b7a9b5f47ebe1.mp3", "Please write five sentences about your best friend.": "audio/cau/9fbb8a8d97d0001d.mp3", "The first sentence is easy, but the other sentences are hard.": "audio/cau/8cf810890ade1eda.mp3", "Jobs and Wozniak set up Apple in 1976.": "audio/cau/48673803c7bf8992.mp3", "Mi set her alarm for six o'clock yesterday.": "audio/cau/92e32160df23e27c.mp3", "My grandma enjoys sewing in her free time.": "audio/cau/8adadfe72a938b50.mp3", "We learn sewing in the craft club.": "audio/cau/52156ba8a0f8387b.mp3", "Let's go to the shop to buy a lamp.": "audio/cau/02d8310bb74af7bc.mp3", "There is a small shop near my house.": "audio/cau/e63a93ab9fc8033d.mp3", "The shopper paid with her phone.": "audio/cau/82693d164cb86375.mp3", "A smart shopper compares prices first.": "audio/cau/b7f5abffe4fe148b.mp3", "My mum goes shopping on Sunday mornings.": "audio/cau/9edd7bc7a6da8213.mp3", "Mi likes shopping at the small shops near her house.": "audio/cau/9b5fc040769efc5a.mp3", "There are many shops along this street.": "audio/cau/f8d089fcbdb1b89b.mp3", "My aunt has a small shop near the school.": "audio/cau/d1a736005c66edb9.mp3", "You should eat more vegetables.": "audio/cau/d3873c12c668ddab.mp3", "We should recycle, and we shouldn't waste water.": "audio/cau/bdd4848df2193265.mp3", "You shouldn't stay up too late.": "audio/cau/680bdbc9338f8ccb.mp3", "You should sleep early and shouldn't skip breakfast.": "audio/cau/a2f566a8bdd973cf.mp3", "Show your photos to the class.": "audio/cau/2238dc578e393ea6.mp3", "Nam showed us photos of his village.": "audio/cau/212c93e8427b7095.mp3", "Hoa is shy, so she speaks quietly.": "audio/cau/ef4e8e7e64f51655.mp3", "Lan was shy at first, but now she is confident.": "audio/cau/2433d33be7d55b3d.mp3", "The new girl smiled shyly at us.": "audio/cau/2d8e39ac5b046bf1.mp3", "He answered the question shyly.": "audio/cau/7bcc93093d7cfbd6.mp3", "Joining a club helped me overcome my shyness.": "audio/cau/cd71a7621cb6f760.mp3", "Her shyness makes it hard to make friends.": "audio/cau/d28374d8d05b64bb.mp3", "There is a significant change in the weather.": "audio/cau/67863b502f69860b.mp3", "Mid-Autumn is a significant festival for children.": "audio/cau/74a1c5a832bdca70.mp3", "My sister is kind and very funny.": "audio/cau/682ebfe0aa138164.mp3", "I have one sister and two brothers.": "audio/cau/14c3dc4d63096025.mp3", "He is a skilful football player.": "audio/cau/646304253edddd34.mp3", "My grandma is skilful at making cakes.": "audio/cau/1c690c4f9b9e86c6.mp3", "Swimming is a very useful skill.": "audio/cau/d7241d53b77c087e.mp3", "Mi is skilled at drawing; it's her best skill.": "audio/cau/cc6e45a927c9f99f.mp3", "My uncle is a skilled artisan in Bat Trang.": "audio/cau/e68305c55d01384c.mp3", "Making pottery is a skill, and he is very skilled.": "audio/cau/9b117236c0cf5e21.mp3", "We learn new skills at the English club.": "audio/cau/84d5837cc14182f6.mp3", "Listening is an important skill, and speaking skills are useful too.": "audio/cau/18ae79d29069fa38.mp3", "I sleep for eight hours every night.": "audio/cau/2d2df36764b2d3d8.mp3", "Nam went to bed late, so he feels sleepy now.": "audio/cau/f0fe4a120a290c36.mp3", "If you're sleepy, you shouldn't ride your bike.": "audio/cau/24b06618dda8e4ce.mp3", "Hoa felt sleepy because she went to bed late.": "audio/cau/6ce80e5117754f2f.mp3", "My house is small but cosy.": "audio/cau/361843b6d8177bed.mp3", "I live in a small flat, not a big house.": "audio/cau/e341afdae498f225.mp3", "I'm so pleased you won the prize!": "audio/cau/345d567c5208a7af.mp3", "It was raining, so we stayed at home.": "audio/cau/d3e8c1c4c40bf63a.mp3", "We use this software to learn English.": "audio/cau/0362daa938440006.mp3", "Dad installed new software on my computer.": "audio/cau/4e88fe3df6e8477f.mp3", "I sometimes walk to school with Nam.": "audio/cau/58614921c43016ec.mp3", "Mi sometimes cooks dinner with her mum.": "audio/cau/cc769dc4c6e5b938.mp3", "Please sort the rubbish before you throw it away.": "audio/cau/6c05fa141d6fcfcf.mp3", "What sort of rubbish can we recycle?": "audio/cau/ece2a3deda17cf66.mp3", "Our city needs more space for parks.": "audio/cau/4789110f4d6851be.mp3", "The new flat is spacious, with lots of space.": "audio/cau/9028743b09798c85.mp3", "Can you speak English well?": "audio/cau/7e70c8ed41dd5f73.mp3", "Mi spoke to her teacher after class.": "audio/cau/9631c4f9d08103cf.mp3", "She spoke English very well.": "audio/cau/021d27ba9b445e58.mp3", "I spoke to my teacher after class.": "audio/cau/8a7ed13ad52bfd30.mp3", "Our English lesson will start at eight.": "audio/cau/920ac7d03b952080.mp3", "We start at seven and finish at eleven.": "audio/cau/f8b0988a876acebc.mp3", "Good sleep keeps you in a healthy state.": "audio/cau/7049cd3c8f8cac73.mp3", "Exercise can improve your state of mind.": "audio/cau/694d7b4b952786de.mp3", "Read the statements and choose True or False.": "audio/cau/5f41d85ba1cc95cf.mp3", "The principal made a statement about the trip.": "audio/cau/9ca8f7090ffddefd.mp3", "Read the statements and choose T or F.": "audio/cau/d81feacfec03b769.mp3", "This statement is true, but the other statements are false.": "audio/cau/d3dd00a2a9c02930.mp3", "We stay in tents at the summer camp.": "audio/cau/2e09709e31b8333c.mp3", "Mi will stay at home, but Nam will leave early.": "audio/cau/d5c48ac441b0c097.mp3", "Lan stays with her grandmother on Sundays.": "audio/cau/b44c1a677410d319.mp3", "He usually stays at home, but last week he stayed with us.": "audio/cau/066aab773dd2f3f9.mp3", "My grandparents still live in the countryside.": "audio/cau/49502abae8b9d76c.mp3", "It is late, but Minh is still studying.": "audio/cau/e4f85c62a0bdae64.mp3", "Please stop talking and listen to me.": "audio/cau/14d99e9f18d5a441.mp3", "The bus will stop here and then start again.": "audio/cau/2af4e67bdadcfda0.mp3", "The store is near our house.": "audio/cau/499a1bc50d7cd647.mp3", "Let's go to the store this weekend.": "audio/cau/df90dc123d86e998.mp3", "Exercise can help you reduce stress.": "audio/cau/22e33d982d8aa525.mp3", "Exams are stressful, so many students feel stressed.": "audio/cau/bf9649e515e0312c.mp3", "Trang feels stressed before her exams.": "audio/cau/391aaca629e80ddb.mp3", "City life is stressful, but I feel relaxed in the countryside.": "audio/cau/432e206709e6350f.mp3", "The week before the exams is very stressful.": "audio/cau/0d92b94536b66fb1.mp3", "Hoa listens to music after a stressful day.": "audio/cau/45aea1d5388baf99.mp3", "Mi is a student at Ba Dinh Secondary School.": "audio/cau/569937b828afcac4.mp3", "Every student must study hard for the test.": "audio/cau/88443b78f0da0120.mp3", "Lan is a studious girl.": "audio/cau/05497c979da2f836.mp3", "Studious students often get good marks.": "audio/cau/56f0c28f3e5463f3.mp3", "I study English every evening.": "audio/cau/2a98035816ae0fe1.mp3", "Hoa is a studious student; she likes to study maths.": "audio/cau/81fcae64bc4c3e71.mp3", "I like her style of dressing.": "audio/cau/71f13f97852baf4a.mp3", "This house is built in an old style.": "audio/cau/39ec10b77e3ccbcf.mp3", "My favourite subject is science.": "audio/cau/a04c6f77a736db47.mp3", "Maths is a hard subject, but I like it.": "audio/cau/47c097cdda067846.mp3", "We study ten subjects at school.": "audio/cau/65e4952b532af83a.mp3", "Of all my subjects, English is my favourite subject.": "audio/cau/b316509d6a4659ff.mp3", "The school festival was very successful.": "audio/cau/07a76776fe266387.mp3", "He is a successful businessman.": "audio/cau/48de355a4bcefbea.mp3", "This summer camp is suitable for teenagers.": "audio/cau/482dbdd6b03dc0b6.mp3", "This film is unsuitable for young children, but it is suitable for us.": "audio/cau/1b8f931fc1085f83.mp3", "Please dress suitably for the ceremony.": "audio/cau/a9bd54a7aec37a96.mp3", "He was suitably prepared for the test.": "audio/cau/1d124d231944fb63.mp3", "Friends support each other in hard times.": "audio/cau/c25544ac51cf812c.mp3", "My parents are supportive; they always support me.": "audio/cau/bc09957a4f6cc0ae.mp3", "The surgeon operated on my grandpa.": "audio/cau/dd5f937cf38fe295.mp3", "She wants to become a surgeon.": "audio/cau/2fb7fbfed4d45d21.mp3", "Surgeons work long hours in hospitals.": "audio/cau/ba94ae9bba06a137.mp3", "Two surgeons did the operation.": "audio/cau/9c4b9b9b26a4caeb.mp3", "In \"don't\", the letter t comes from not.": "audio/cau/549e7bc5a2456c75.mp3", "I didn't go out because I was tired.": "audio/cau/5cc7479c1b749e64.mp3", "Put your books on the table, please.": "audio/cau/467dab8d487aa55a.mp3", "Our timetable is a table of all our lessons.": "audio/cau/995dc4d40f2b5ff8.mp3", "Hoi An is famous for its tailoring.": "audio/cau/f9e5a45a3fd234f7.mp3", "My aunt learned tailoring when she was young.": "audio/cau/1a0a7940d5d2f341.mp3", "Don't forget to take your umbrella.": "audio/cau/d1c93b06561e343d.mp3", "I take the bus to school; yesterday I took a taxi.": "audio/cau/6de67298648ceb25.mp3", "I often talk to my grandma on the phone.": "audio/cau/30262ea1745db608.mp3", "Lan is talkative; she loves to talk and chat with friends.": "audio/cau/ef14453a567466fc.mp3", "My little sister is very talkative.": "audio/cau/abe6afbd7c67a621.mp3", "He is shy, not talkative.": "audio/cau/c9c299a5fd04a0e9.mp3", "Mum's spring rolls are very tasty.": "audio/cau/3e36af0fdc823b82.mp3", "This street food is cheap and tasty.": "audio/cau/ecba6c175b91796e.mp3", "My mother will teach me how to cook.": "audio/cau/a219134d114e3ba6.mp3", "Mr Minh taught me English, and he is a great teacher.": "audio/cau/f4262b30c0d7e28d.mp3", "Our English teacher is very kind.": "audio/cau/4869000a32bce322.mp3", "Ms Hoa taught us maths last year; she is a great teacher.": "audio/cau/01cfa396481f53ff.mp3", "Ms Lan is teaching Class 6A now.": "audio/cau/acf50be4cb481bbc.mp3", "My aunt is a teacher; she loves teaching.": "audio/cau/8c228681a916a270.mp3", "Nam is in the school football team.": "audio/cau/1461f5ac62622ac5.mp3", "Our team won because of good teamwork.": "audio/cau/8c1642773db7fc33.mp3", "Nam is my teammate in the football club.": "audio/cau/8aad427069b03f2b.mp3", "Help your teammates during the game.": "audio/cau/aa515263fb79e5ef.mp3", "Teamwork is important in our project.": "audio/cau/2dab89eaeac4edea.mp3", "Each team needs good teamwork to win.": "audio/cau/e87a0a5f8aa964a4.mp3", "There are many technological changes today.": "audio/cau/33a74b88547cb63e.mp3", "Robots are a great technological invention.": "audio/cau/ee3060503424ac39.mp3", "Technology has changed our lives a lot.": "audio/cau/05507c037515517a.mp3", "He started a technology company and became successful.": "audio/cau/2afc10a553e39d7d.mp3", "They have a teenaged daughter.": "audio/cau/1b111e9b0df811c8.mp3", "Teenaged players joined the team.": "audio/cau/406c4060d8e83f72.mp3", "A teenager's life can be busy.": "audio/cau/62fee043f1ca3601.mp3", "This is a typical teenager's room.": "audio/cau/5c98ae66743caacc.mp3", "Trang makes a plan at the beginning of each term.": "audio/cau/fec4f7f99f908566.mp3", "Nam has three tests at the end of the term.": "audio/cau/3266aa36a32c395b.mp3", "We have termly tests in maths.": "audio/cau/fdf717a2fc8f093e.mp3", "Parents receive a termly report.": "audio/cau/9fc7d85ae0dbd8fe.mp3", "Read the text and answer the questions.": "audio/cau/11d0eb5cbe887ed7.mp3", "The text is on page 20 of the textbook.": "audio/cau/d58a68e9e3987cad.mp3", "Open your textbook at page 20.": "audio/cau/915c1eaa49971a81.mp3", "I forgot my English textbook at home.": "audio/cau/a4a2d63649c29215.mp3", "Read the two texts and compare them.": "audio/cau/c807be1a6c25d189.mp3", "Mi sends me texts every day; this text is from her.": "audio/cau/2bea2a0f26cc7d4b.mp3", "Thank you for your help.": "audio/cau/f1b6ff2034f49180.mp3", "I want to thank my teacher; I am thankful to her.": "audio/cau/e425280c59f568bd.mp3", "We are thankful to the people in our community.": "audio/cau/223a6b926026e8db.mp3", "I am thankful for your help, so I thank you a lot.": "audio/cau/6f44905722dacb4f.mp3", "Thankfully, nobody was hurt.": "audio/cau/7bd5f8cb0cb1f3b1.mp3", "Thankfully, the rain stopped before the match.": "audio/cau/80e95fd617deb78b.mp3", "I think he is a great person.": "audio/cau/9ae2e70b49a3159f.mp3", "I thought about his story, and I think it is true.": "audio/cau/9f8df7704c81c77d.mp3", "He is a creative thinker.": "audio/cau/f59f27869620f000.mp3", "Confucius was a great thinker.": "audio/cau/e0d23762cc277705.mp3", "That's a good thought!": "audio/cau/4c84ec15bb96b916.mp3", "I thought the test was easy.": "audio/cau/164ed73b13b1af06.mp3", "It was thoughtful of you to bring me flowers.": "audio/cau/baaadaf968d1f491.mp3", "My grandmother is a thoughtful person.": "audio/cau/a52bbd2ea31bf2b4.mp3", "What time is it now, Mum?": "audio/cau/1cbca6b4e0afa66c.mp3", "Look at the timetable; it is time for maths.": "audio/cau/9b6fb48058293171.mp3", "Let's look at our new timetable.": "audio/cau/b37160eda36c9395.mp3", "We have Maths on Monday according to the timetable.": "audio/cau/46e65b162f79e5db.mp3", "I feel tired after a long day at school.": "audio/cau/38f8f044711c6b62.mp3", "The trip was tiring, so we were all tired.": "audio/cau/d54ee95b19e43d5d.mp3", "Tiredness can make you angry.": "audio/cau/9d227407834f25e4.mp3", "Drink water to reduce tiredness.": "audio/cau/fc6c6fedf46a98e7.mp3", "It was a long and tiring day.": "audio/cau/0665fbc1cb4ea05d.mp3", "Climbing the mountain is tiring.": "audio/cau/71046ae4668b7317.mp3", "Today is Monday, and I have maths.": "audio/cau/a2c1db38d6bad1f7.mp3", "It is sunny today, so we play outside.": "audio/cau/43f448f8abe01280.mp3", "Lan is going to bed early tonight.": "audio/cau/082a4a419bcc862e.mp3", "If you stay up late tonight, you might feel tired tomorrow.": "audio/cau/67679aa3684d9212.mp3", "I like swimming, and my sister likes it too.": "audio/cau/695ee0e76ca64b23.mp3", "This tea is too hot; I also want some water.": "audio/cau/641c64a35c7075e8.mp3", "I live in a small town near the sea.": "audio/cau/d1834f8b57570cad.mp3", "My town is bigger than my grandparents' village.": "audio/cau/5dce2eb178b20c1e.mp3", "We went to Hue by train.": "audio/cau/0131cf3fca359ac1.mp3", "The train leaves the station at six.": "audio/cau/f47b7035aa339397.mp3", "She is a trainee teacher.": "audio/cau/8381752caa89fc9e.mp3", "The trainees learn from the chef.": "audio/cau/c5fa19c4afef7ff5.mp3", "My trainer helps me get fit.": "audio/cau/1330fae4fd91e16d.mp3", "The dog trainer is very patient.": "audio/cau/afceb91aad4b32e6.mp3", "Mai takes a training course on time management at school.": "audio/cau/a7ab4a64de2ddf3c.mp3", "Nam has football training every Saturday.": "audio/cau/594873cbffeb57ec.mp3", "I tried to accomplish my goal of cycling five kilometres a day.": "audio/cau/3db6bdb7b910b612.mp3", "Hoa tried to finish her homework early.": "audio/cau/1e93b2dcd428c99f.mp3", "I'm truly sorry.": "audio/cau/e7ae5dcb584f8045.mp3", "It was a truly beautiful day.": "audio/cau/b7c3ef82c1d2475c.mp3", "Let's try this new game, Nam!": "audio/cau/9540039a577e2fee.mp3", "Hoa tried hard, and she didn't give up.": "audio/cau/deeed17a1fca8206.mp3", "A flat is a type of house.": "audio/cau/b519e22f39271e2a.mp3", "What type of house do you like? I like this kind.": "audio/cau/256a68fa7015d647.mp3", "There are many types of houses in Viet Nam.": "audio/cau/e5ec6990a0243557.mp3", "A villa is one type of house; which type do you like?": "audio/cau/36ad9745be611d00.mp3", "Below are some of the typical things I did.": "audio/cau/66d53ae758a3f7b4.mp3", "Pho is a typical Vietnamese breakfast.": "audio/cau/fbe03a0e67ca0879.mp3", "I was unable to come to the party.": "audio/cau/9a33ddb403bf9924.mp3", "She is unable to swim.": "audio/cau/c9dd522be7beb748.mp3", "Bullying is unacceptable.": "audio/cau/592a33bec5fd4192.mp3", "Your behaviour is unacceptable.": "audio/cau/032ef3a6ad4e0065.mp3", "Do you understand the question, Hoa?": "audio/cau/4aad582adc859dab.mp3", "Minh understood the lesson, but Lan didn't understand it.": "audio/cau/d720b04327d8be8a.mp3", "I understood the lesson well.": "audio/cau/1d67b1ee5c74135b.mp3", "Have you understood the question?": "audio/cau/a1e59e5170364849.mp3", "The shop assistant was unhelpful.": "audio/cau/72e4a1fc9b333f47.mp3", "This map is unhelpful.": "audio/cau/a647e15849c7448e.mp3", "Don't worry about unimportant things.": "audio/cau/f07810c695be3310.mp3", "This detail is unimportant.": "audio/cau/532d9addcc7fece9.mp3", "The film was long and uninteresting.": "audio/cau/fe255bc43d0bc7d1.mp3", "Nothing is uninteresting if you look closely.": "audio/cau/fbd9a81d434e40b7.mp3", "My brother studies at a university in Ha Noi.": "audio/cau/d31bb0ff48e0784e.mp3", "I want to go to university in the future.": "audio/cau/e1a5eee05092757d.mp3", "Turn off unnecessary lights.": "audio/cau/5283f14f10a6242d.mp3", "Don't buy unnecessary things.": "audio/cau/3c196996ebaf5b8d.mp3", "Give your unneeded clothes to charity.": "audio/cau/51be808aa1e5c17d.mp3", "We threw away the unneeded boxes.": "audio/cau/64c9c2b8514c0fc4.mp3", "The new rule is unpopular with students.": "audio/cau/0273c12663516408.mp3", "This game is unpopular now.": "audio/cau/6dc0deb47558dd88.mp3", "Your plan is unrealistic.": "audio/cau/b58c487664bbd6b5.mp3", "It's unrealistic to learn English in one week.": "audio/cau/a6f742491d745339.mp3", "This question is unrelated to the topic.": "audio/cau/d8596f30a9395e8c.mp3", "The two events are unrelated.": "audio/cau/39f0a6b8e99e6c31.mp3", "This film is unsuitable for children.": "audio/cau/4d063cf5aaf27267.mp3", "These shoes are unsuitable for hiking.": "audio/cau/d2c24559d87dfe9e.mp3", "We use computers to make our visual story.": "audio/cau/1f9e65093a2c0cf1.mp3", "This app is very useful, and I use it every day.": "audio/cau/7434eb2ec1577d85.mp3", "Minh used his pocket money to buy books.": "audio/cau/8d9cef6778350b8f.mp3", "Mi used her phone to take photos, and it was very useful.": "audio/cau/ee5a3633f90de6fb.mp3", "This dictionary is very useful.": "audio/cau/d616d82dd437efdf.mp3", "A computer is useful, but a broken one is useless.": "audio/cau/061aada006d6e574.mp3", "This broken umbrella is useless.": "audio/cau/87f4d5c1e27eee06.mp3", "It's useless to cry now.": "audio/cau/d2efa23c3f23f8b7.mp3", "Facebook has millions of users.": "audio/cau/3955ede83592bd40.mp3", "Enter your user name here.": "audio/cau/8f967e17a7ac312d.mp3", "She is using a computer to write her story.": "audio/cau/c0867dfe4d3cf7aa.mp3", "Minh used a map yesterday, and today he is using his phone.": "audio/cau/2f51e71c740b9c6e.mp3", "I usually get up at six o'clock.": "audio/cau/56d7578c4454be93.mp3", "Mi usually walks to school, so it is unusual for her to be late.": "audio/cau/3e33c944667515e1.mp3", "How about + V-ing? How about going to the park?": "audio/cau/4bd32e061c4f1188.mp3", "In the formula, V means a verb, like 'go' or 'play'.": "audio/cau/2a5961c55ebdeb37.mp3", "'Play' is a verb, but 'happy' is not.": "audio/cau/7cb0163f6a27d0af.mp3", "Underline the verb in each sentence.": "audio/cau/c45fa8ec83b8ba93.mp3", "My school is very big and beautiful.": "audio/cau/5cd4ea7091dbf666.mp3", "Thank you very much for your help.": "audio/cau/162955bdaf4118ee.mp3", "Millions of viewers watched the match.": "audio/cau/add62fdbb00cba64.mp3", "The programme is popular with viewers.": "audio/cau/f4f1d2c65fa3997b.mp3", "My grandparents live in a small village.": "audio/cau/959ff3761670ea0d.mp3", "The villagers in our village grow rice.": "audio/cau/c5c92b3fc554d83c.mp3", "The villagers are very friendly.": "audio/cau/83b65e1cf54c314b.mp3", "A villager showed us the way.": "audio/cau/8c99ee2c847588ae.mp3", "There are many craft villages near Ha Noi.": "audio/cau/9064f8b48096eb71.mp3", "Bat Trang is a famous pottery village.": "audio/cau/7212e9943aa25d4c.mp3", "My cousin goes to a vocational school.": "audio/cau/50ca5a6882ddb9d6.mp3", "Vocational training helps young people find jobs.": "audio/cau/75b1e5786be3eb6f.mp3", "I want to go to the summer camp.": "audio/cau/16ac9d133b953dea.mp3", "Minh wanted a new bike, and he still wants one.": "audio/cau/74bcc5e39e26178a.mp3", "Mi wants to live in a big city.": "audio/cau/8d3e0f754ef95b04.mp3", "Nam wants to be a doctor because he wants to help people.": "audio/cau/c9ea53f361e19fe4.mp3", "It's warm today.": "audio/cau/cc0e8ca9006d57a2.mp3", "Wear a warm coat in winter.": "audio/cau/95aec6c826de01b5.mp3", "Nam was at home yesterday.": "audio/cau/faca1649a4ef8a76.mp3", "I was tired, but my friends were happy.": "audio/cau/e3e7c2c50296c48e.mp3", "Lan sings very well.": "audio/cau/8d831f0b90fa91ed.mp3", "Nam plays football well, but Phong plays better.": "audio/cau/7c13b2c077241009.mp3", "We went to the summer camp last June.": "audio/cau/577b7f143e454603.mp3", "Mi usually goes by bus, but yesterday she went by bike.": "audio/cau/bf4b0b541f770b47.mp3", "They were in Ha Noi last year.": "audio/cau/a884324b521a97cd.mp3", "I was at school, and my parents were at work.": "audio/cau/d6c97d0e9f2b3c05.mp3", "Tuan tells a joke and the whole class laughs.": "audio/cau/72200be54ac56f1e.mp3", "We cleaned the whole house in one day.": "audio/cau/9e8c820037d2934c.mp3", "I will help you with your homework.": "audio/cau/09b1efdcdb577f02.mp3", "Lan will visit us tomorrow, but Nam won't come.": "audio/cau/b87ff8c1b6e3e1d4.mp3", "I wish I could fly.": "audio/cau/1f4f98c1346e3311.mp3", "We wish you a happy new year.": "audio/cau/f468722ef2819696.mp3", "She was the first woman to win the prize.": "audio/cau/fd0356da8b619a67.mp3", "That woman is a doctor, and those women are nurses.": "audio/cau/325ae60d55daac3d.mp3", "Write the new word in your notebook.": "audio/cau/8b8bb3be1461f910.mp3", "This word has two syllables.": "audio/cau/3c07a10113a0df79.mp3", "Learn five new words every day.": "audio/cau/adb2b8f5372e6050.mp3", "Match the words with the pictures, one word for each picture.": "audio/cau/0c015f99a499421d.mp3", "My parents work in a hospital in Ha Noi.": "audio/cau/4a34bda1f13dc400.mp3", "My uncle is a hard-working worker; he works every day.": "audio/cau/4fe31bc354d9e0c5.mp3", "He worked hard all his life.": "audio/cau/ba4d7cb0d29b578d.mp3", "Dad works in a factory, and he worked on a farm before.": "audio/cau/a8beb5a41e4b8a92.mp3", "The worker wears a helmet.": "audio/cau/9c235c7e97cd46ce.mp3", "Factory workers work long hours.": "audio/cau/dd3d0d4cd13eb0b4.mp3", "My mum is working in the garden now.": "audio/cau/0fc0a939dbaf61f1.mp3", "Dad works hard, and today he is working late.": "audio/cau/8fff1884b3def435.mp3", "She was one of the most famous scientists in the world.": "audio/cau/60bcc9b6651e1a00.mp3", "Pho is famous all over the world.": "audio/cau/5cc0d2280fff73e9.mp3", "Their products are sold worldwide.": "audio/cau/33dc1c140e6b7e3c.mp3", "This game is popular all over the world.": "audio/cau/6841bcd23e5d5707.mp3", "Mi is worried about her exam.": "audio/cau/646395233a7957de.mp3", "Don't worry, Nam; there's nothing to be worried about.": "audio/cau/bd1bb04640424333.mp3", "Would you like to live here?": "audio/cau/648fc211b3b7e91a.mp3", "I would like a villa with a big garden.": "audio/cau/af8db0397bcb6281.mp3", "Please write your name here.": "audio/cau/a728b2e865ff5c76.mp3", "Mi likes to write, and she wrote a story yesterday.": "audio/cau/a907f42938059961.mp3", "My aunt is a writer.": "audio/cau/0b898dc7eb5824c9.mp3", "Mi wants to be a writer because she loves to write stories.": "audio/cau/5ce118b1d0da266b.mp3", "Nam writes to his parents every week.": "audio/cau/108aa6e9d6ef5292.mp3", "Lan wrote a story last year, and now she writes a blog.": "audio/cau/6f6500e7710ae853.mp3", "She was writing a book when I phoned her.": "audio/cau/97a3ce971a3a7562.mp3", "Mi is writing a letter, and she wrote one yesterday too.": "audio/cau/f5189e5fac049044.mp3", "Lan's answer was wrong, so she tried again.": "audio/cau/1b25a01594f7e8c8.mp3", "You look sad, Minh. What's wrong?": "audio/cau/bde31146d26c8a31.mp3", "Lie becomes lying: change 'ie' to y and add -ing.": "audio/cau/ccd0d01ed2295121.mp3", "The word 'yellow' begins with the letter y.": "audio/cau/413244207833f8bd.mp3", "My uncle is young and active.": "audio/cau/25ab8c1b23e804a5.mp3", "Nam is younger than Minh, but they are both young.": "audio/cau/ae83efbb6b4f31bc.mp3", "My younger brother is eight years old.": "audio/cau/4f32791e715fc8a4.mp3", "Lan is young, and her sister is even younger.": "audio/cau/a298d4fd339450fa.mp3", "My grandpa often talks about his youth.": "audio/cau/2cc4847b1b21067b.mp3", "The youth club meets on Saturdays.": "audio/cau/b613598b5b961ed0.mp3"};
